    "description": "Discover unusual accommodation with huts perched or on the water, ideal for a weekend with family or lovers near the Vosges in Haute-Saône.",
    "text": "Welcome | Cabanes des Grands Lacs | Coucoo Cabanes, Haute-Saône By using this website, you agree to the storage of cookies on your device to improve site navigation, analyze site usage, and contribute to our marketing efforts. Check out our Confidentiality Policy for more information. I understand Refuse Coucoo Cabanes Seminars Contact & access +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 Langue Français English German Cabanes SERVICES Well-being activities Gift vouchers Reserve Cabanes Discover our huts Tree houses Floating huts Cabins on stilts Experiences Well-being activities Gift vouchers FAQS CGV BLOG Photo gallery Partners Join us Seminars Contact +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 Discover our huts Tree houses Floating huts Cabins on stilts Haute-Saône Coucoo Cabanes welcome to C abanes des grands lacs 45 minutes from Besançon in Bourgogne-Franche-Comté, near Switzerland and the Grand Est region. The 29 cabins of the domain welcome you in a preserved natural setting on an area of 150 hectares: 70 hectares of forest and 80 hectares of lakes. The site is a genuine haven ideal for lovers, families and groups of friends in search of disconnection and well-being. The domain is certified European ecolabel since December 2024. ‍ On the program of your stay: comfortable night under the stars, tasting gourmet baskets made from local products, relaxing in your heated Nordic bath or with our massages, walks and activities on site and in the region. A memorable experience in harmony with nature to share with your loved ones... Opening 2026: from March 20 to November 21. La Forge de Bonnal, 70230 Chassey-lès-Montbozon OUR cabinS Authentic and comfortable cabins, different from each other and carefully integrated into their natural environment. All our cabins are equipped with dry toilets, heating, indoor and outdoor furniture, full bedding and breakfast included. Some have a water reserve. Our Spa cabins (with private heated Nordic bath) have electricity, a coffee machine and bathrobes. Duo cabins can accommodate 2 cabin lovers; Family cabins have a capacity of 2 to 6/7 people. Discover all our cabins Domain map PERCHED IN THE TREES cabins Go on an adventure in our cabins perched between 4 and 9 meters high, accessible by stairs, suspension bridges or ladders. Imagine yourself, Breakfast with birdsong , surrounded by the trees and the sun's rays through the branches. An unforgettable stay awaits you in our perched cocoons in the heart of the forest. Our perched cabins Floating cabins Embark on a unique stay In our floating huts , accessible by boat or by a pontoon. Offeror a breathtaking view of the lakes , these havens of peace invite you to a total immersion in nature. Let yourself be lulled by the lapping of the water, admire the reflections of the sky on the shimmering surface of the lakes, and enjoy a timeless escape. Our floating cabins Cabins On stilts Discover perfect harmony between forest and lake with our huts on stilts. Slightly perched at the edge of or near the water, thes"
