    "description": "Organize seminars in a unique natural setting, with tree houses or on the water for a unique experience in Franche-Comté.",
    "text": "Seminars | Cabanes des Grands Lacs | Close to Switzerland By using this website, you agree to the storage of cookies on your device to improve site navigation, analyze site usage, and contribute to our marketing efforts. Check out our Confidentiality Policy for more information. I understand Refuse Coucoo Cabanes Seminars Contact & access +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 Langue Français English German Cabanes SERVICES Well-being activities Gift vouchers Reserve Cabanes Discover our huts Tree houses Floating huts Cabins on stilts Experiences Well-being activities Gift vouchers FAQS CGV BLOG Photo gallery Partners Join us Seminars Contact +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 Discover our huts Tree houses Floating huts Cabins on stilts Seminar IN HAUTE-SAÔNE: ORGANIZE YOUR EVENT in NATURE at the Cabanes des Grands Lacs Organizing a seminar or other event in Haute-Saône means offering your teams a real break in the countryside, in the heart of Bourgogne-Franche-Comté. At the Cabanes des Grands Lacs, nature becomes a breeding ground for reflection, cohesion and sharing, far from the rhythm of daily life. It's up to you to disconnect! ‍ Our domain mainly hosts seminars and corporate events up to 30 people. Depending on the format imagined, the capacity can be adapted: meetings, working hours, convivial moments or residential seminar, each project is tailor-made. For larger groups, do not hesitate to contact our team. Close to Switzerland, our geographical location appeals to companies looking for an accessible, exotic and inspiring place to bring their collaborators together. Preserved natural setting, comfortable accommodations , meeting spaces and attentive support: everything is there to design a different business seminar, where you take the time to reconnect with what is essential and with others. An exceptional natural domain of 150 hectares 29 perched, floating and stilt huts (from 2 to 6/7 people) Flexible spaces Meals based on local products Wellness, sports and nature activities Partial or complete privatization of the site An attentive team to organize your tailor-made event Events for everyone Aux Cabanes des Grands Lacs , we welcome your corporate events in Haute-Saône, in a natural setting conducive to disconnection, sharing and getting back to basics. Green seminar, collective work time or team building, each format is part of an experience designed for your teams, in the middle of nature and near Switzerland. ‍ Green seminar : An exotic environment, between lakes and forest, to think differently and promote authentic exchanges. Residential seminar in Haute-Saône : Extend the experience with nights on site, to experience a natural break and strengthen team cohesion! ; Team building nature : Group outdoor time to create links and unite your employees, at the rhythm of nature. Wellness stays surrounded by nature : Yoga or meditation retreat: experiences dedicated to well-being and reconnection to yourself. Product launch or press event : An inspiring place to prese"
