    "description": "Find contact and access information to enjoy an unusual stay in our huts perched or on the water, in the heart of nature.",
    "text": "Contact and Access | Cabanes des Grands Lacs | Near the Vosges By using this website, you agree to the storage of cookies on your device to improve site navigation, analyze site usage, and contribute to our marketing efforts. Check out our Confidentiality Policy for more information. I understand Refuse Coucoo Cabanes Seminars Contact & access +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 Langue Français English German Cabanes SERVICES Well-being activities Gift vouchers Reserve Cabanes Discover our huts Tree houses Floating huts Cabins on stilts Experiences Well-being activities Gift vouchers FAQS CGV BLOG Photo gallery Partners Join us Seminars Contact +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 Discover our huts Tree houses Floating huts Cabins on stilts Contact & access To contact us Information and reservations: ‍ Phone : +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 (Monday to Friday from 9 a.m. to 5 p.m.). ‍ Mail : reservation@cabanesdesgrandslacs.com ‍ Press/influencers: If you want to publish an article about our cabins or organize an influencer trip, do not hesitate to write to us at partenariats@coucoocabanes.com and let us know that you are contacting us for Les Cabanes des Grands Lacs. Consult our FAQ. TO ACCESS to cabanes des grands lacs cabanes des grands lacs La Forge de Bonnal - 70230 Chassey-lès-Montbozon Make your itinerary with Google maps By car: Enter 'Cabanes des Grands Lacs' into your GPS. Electric charging station available on site next to the eco-hut. Following an adjustment by the manufacturer, Renault vehicles (such as ZOE and TWINGO) will not be able to be charged at the domain sockets. Work is in progress from the Rougemont/Bonnal access at least until June 2026. If you arrive via Bonnal, you have to go through Tressandans -> Chassey-lès-Montbozon -> Cabanes. By train: ‍ Vesoul station (30 km) ‍ Besancon train station (55 km) By train + bike: Take the train to Vesoul station (3:30), then cycle the last kilometers (2 hours) between villages and forests! Our itinerary with Hourrail. other exceptional domains Coucoo Cabanes now includes 9 locations across 7 regions in France, including a new opening this autumn: the Cabanes des Veilleurs near the Châteaux de la Loire. Discover the other areas Follow our adventures cabanes des grands lacs La Forge de Bonnal 70230 Chassey-lès-Montbozon reservation@cabanesdesgrandslacs.com +33 (0) 3 84 77 06 72 Architects of progressive tourism Subscribe to our newsletter Thank you, we have received your registration! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. FAQS blog CGV Photo gallery map Partenaires Join us © Cabanes des Grands Lacs 2026 • Legal information • Confidentiality policy • Powered by Call Reserve"
