 everyday, our spa cabins offer the perfect balance of relaxation and charm, promising an experience as rejuvenating as it is inspiring . Online booking NATURE, DETOX, SLOW, CHIC Four words that capture the essence of Pella Roca, where every stay is designed for relaxation, escape, and pure well-being in the heart of nature For the best rates book your stay directly with us. Choose your dates and extras to enjoy a moment of pure relaxation and indulgence thanks to the hot tub and sauna in your cabin. Follow the link for information, special offers and availability ENJOY > Gift Vouchers Give someone a magical experience, a moment to share, or a well-deserved break far from it all... An unusual stay, a romantic weekend, or simply the joy of escaping the everyday—every occasion is perfect for a getaway in a Spa cabin! Offer the gift of a NUIT CHIC, NUIT GLAM, NUIT CLASSE, or NUIT LOVE, and let them enjoy a unique and unforgettable experience. Find out more about our gift vouchers here... GIVE > Privat"
