   {
    "url": "https://en.les-cabanes-dans-les-arbres.com/bretagne-loire-normandie/dihan",
    "final": "https://en.les-cabanes-dans-les-arbres.com/bretagne-loire-normandie/dihan",
    "title": "Dihan - Hotel de Cabanes | Luxury Glamping Near Carnac, Brittany",
    "description": "Dihan Hotel de Cabanes | 25-hectare eco-glamping near Carnac and Quiberon. Romantic treehouses, pond cabins, bubble domes, wooden pool, spa, local breakfasts and outdoor activities.",
    "text": "--> Dihan - Hotel de Cabanes | Luxury Glamping Near Carnac, Brittany Book a cabin Destinations Gift cards Favorites Offers Connexion Sign up Home Gift a voucher All our estates Special offers Favorites Join us Help Blog Our values Our destinations Stay ideas barreRecherche#toggleRepeatPanel\"> When are you leaving? Destination Arrival - Departure Travelers Close | Ok Arrival Departure See all cabins Menu Map Gift card Account Home Domaine hébergement insolite Treehouses in France Bretagne, Loire & Normandie Dihan - Hôtel De Cabanes Dihan - Hotel de Cabanes: Eco-Glamping Near Carnac and Quiberon 4.96 (5 reviews ) Hosts / Welcome 5.0 The place 5.0 The accommodation 4.8 Cleanliness 5 Description accuracy 5.0 Ploemel (Morbihan - Bretagne) 19 accommodations on this estate Practical info Your hosts Options and services Location Activities Surroundings Reviews Description Nestled on a landscaped 25-hectare estate between Carnac and the Quiberon peninsula, Dihan Hotel de Cabanes offers a restorative forest escape just 7 km from the sea. Housed in a converted family farmhouse, the property blends sustainable construction with refined comfort: treehouses, lov'nids and suspended bubbles, pond cabins with wood-fired Finnish baths, roulottes, domes, bohemian guest rooms, and cosy lodges in the meadow. Each accommodation is designed for disconnection, offering private terraces, ecological insulation, and carefully chosen local materials. Wellness and slow living are central to the Dihan experience. Guests can relax in the wooden outdoor pool, book a massage or hammam at the onsite spa, or warm up in the sauna. Several cabins include private spas and jacuzzis, and some lakeside cabins offer a wood-fired Finnish bath ready on arrival. The Dihan Café lounge serves locavore breakfast baskets (including organic apple juice from Carnac) and original room-service baskets for dinner—an ideal option for romantic evenings or family gatherings. For groups of 15+, tailored catering and event space are available upon request. Outdoor activities abound: explore the Ria d'Etel by paddle, rent a bike to visit megalithic sites of Carnac, or book surf lessons in partnership with Odyssey Surf School. The estate encourages quiet discovery—wildlife sightings, meadow walks, and evening star gazing from a private terrace are common highlights. Practical information ensures a smooth stay: reception is open 9:30–12:30 and 15:00–19:30, arrivals between 16:30 and 19:00, and departures are at 11:00. Pets are not accepted, and same-day bookings close at 15:00. Dihan Hotel de Cabanes is ideal for couples seeking a romantic retreat, families in search of unusual nights, and travellers who value sustainable comfort. Whether you come for a private spa cabin on the water, a starlit dome, or a cosy room above the farm, Dihan invites you to slow down, reconnect with nature, and savor the Breton coastline. Estate photo gallery +21 Dihan Hôtel nature en Morbihan Sud Une découverte à 360° \" > The un"
