for you, without pressures... to go further in the sensory immersion. Discover Enjoy our current offers “DISCOVERY” OFFER Take a break from your weekends to enjoy our Discovery offer during the week. Reconnect with the essentials: the silence of a forest, the light filtering through the branches, the comfort of a perched lodge, isolated from the noise of the world. Once you discover it, you’ll become addicted! From €290 per night “ESCAPADE” PACKAGE Make the most of your romantic getaway: a bottle of champagne will be waiting for you in your lodge upon arrival, dinner (starter, main course, dessert) in one of our restaurants* or in your lodge*, and breakfast delivered to your cozy retreat so you can enjoy the awakening of nature. From €530 per night \"CELEBRATION\" PACKAGE Celebrate a special date or anniversary. Treat yourself to a unique experience with the person of your choice. Romantic decorations, sweet treats to share, and a bottle of champagne await you in your lodge! And when you wake up, break"
