    "title": "Hôtel Particulier Montmartre",
    "description": "With its 5 suites, a glamorous restaurant, a cocktail bar: Le Très Particulier, and the biggest hotel garden of the capital, the Hôtel Particulier Montmartre is a unique experience in the heart of the City of Light.",
    "text": "Hôtel Particulier Montmartre APPDRAG toggle navigation Overview Hotel Restaurant Bar Events Shop Voucher Contact Single item Container Overview Hotel Restaurant Bar Events Shop Voucher Contact BOOK 01 53 41 81 40 FR - EN Reservation 23, AVENUE JUNOT, PAVILLON D, 75018 PARIS Activate popup Non Popup Delay before opening (in milliseconds) 1000 Opens each time you navigate (Yes / No) Non Popup Generator This section will not be visible on the site when browsing, it is only used to fill in the Popup opening information. Documentation 1/2 Activate popup Ecrire \"Non\" pour ne pas qu'elle apparaisse et \"Oui\" pour qu'elle apparaisse. Ne surtout pas traduire \"Non\" et \"Oui\" dans le menu de langues Popup Double click on it then click on one time Link (or link ) for information: - The page to be opened as a popup in Website page - The Modal size (or Modal size ) between small, medium and large. The button will be activated automatically once a delay has elapsed. Documentation 2/2 Delay before opening Delay in milliseconds before the popup opens. Opens on each navigation If \"Yes\", the popup will reopen each time the user returns to the homepage. Otherwise, it will only open on the first visit and won’t reopen when the user returns to the site from the same browser (unless the popup’s name changes). WELCOME TO OUR SPECIAL HOUSE Welcome to Hôtel Particulier Montmartre , a family home deeply rooted in Parisian history, often regarded as the \"French Château Marmont.\" Nestled in the heart of a protected garden, our house is a living piece of the Maquis de Montmartre heritage. . Come enjoy a drink, dine, or spend the night in this tranquil oasis, a true \"countryside in the heart of Paris.\" Here, you are more than a guest; you are part of our family. A green haven nestled between the famous Avenue Junot and Rue Lepic, the last vestige of the Maquis de Montmartre, a historical treasure of the Butte. Come enjoy our gardens, a true haven of peace in the heart of Paris. RESTAURANT From breakfast to dinner, in an intimate and refined setting, our restaurant invites you to enjoy French, seasonal cuisine. Each dish is crafted from fresh, high-quality ingredients, carefully selected from the best French producers. DISCOVER BAR Jealously hidden in the heart of a green haven, Le Très Particulier is a bar for connoisseurs, where the art of sophisticated cocktails is revealed. Let yourself be carried away by the falling night, amidst golden gleams and nature. DISCOVER BOOK A TABLE OUR SUITES Unusual nights in unique suites. DISCOVER OUR SUITES OUR NEIGHBORHOOD Perched on a hill overlooking Paris, Montmartre is the artists’ quarter, full of charm and creativity. At its summit stands the iconic Sacré-Cœur Basilica, offering breathtaking views of the City of Light. Paris, the capital of love, reveals its poetic soul in the cobbled streets and timeless atmosphere of Montmartre. FIND US ON INSTAGRAM FAQ SEE YOU (VERY) SOON KEEP IN TOUCH INSTAGRAM FACEBOOK 23, AVENUE JUNOT, PAVILLON D"
