    "url": "https://en.lerefuge-valdisere.com/",
    "final": "https://en.lerefuge-valdisere.com/",
    "title": "Le Refuge de Solaise | Alt. 2551m | Luxury hotel in Val d'Isère",
    "description": "Staying at the Refuge de Solaise, a luxury hotel in Val d'Isère, means watching the sunrise and sunset at an altitude of 2551 metres.",
    "text": "Le Refuge de Solaise | Alt. 2551m | Luxury hotel in Val d'Isère Rooms & Apartments Restaurants & Bar Spa & Wellness Events Activities To offer To offer Access & Contact Membership winter SUMMER GTC Terms and conditions FAQ Find us on Menu winter SUMMER FR EN Book CLOSE Hotel Restaurant Spa Seminars The Solaise Refuge wraps up its summer season After a summer at the summit, the Solaise Refuge is closing its doors for a few months. Thank you all for sharing this season with us at an elevation of 2,551 meters. We’re already looking forward to seeing you again in December—this time in the snow. See you at the summit this winter. ‍ Immersion in the high mountains Perched atop the slopes of the Solaise ski area in Val d'Isère, Le Refuge de Solaise invites guests to recharge their batteries while enjoying the mountains and soothing landscapes. Staying here means living in tune with the light, surrounded by magnificent panoramas, in an environment untouched by the hustle and bustle of the world below. ‍ Le Refuge de Solaise offers rooms decorated with wood and fabrics, a cozy dormitory, four private apartments, several restaurants, a spa, and a 25-meter swimming pool: a true cocoon at high altitude. Rooms and Apartments THE ROOMS The apartments THE DORMITORY Restaurant Le Refuge Savoyard cuisine and panoramic views The Le Refuge restaurant, dedicated to mountain specialities, offers generous, authentic Savoyard cuisine. Enjoy the warm atmosphere of the restaurant or its vast sunny terrace offering spectacular views. Experiences more information SPA & Wellness Forget about time, between luxury and wellness at altitude. more information Activities Discover snowy and icy landscapes. more information Events Enchanting retreat facing the mountains. more information Restaurants & Bar Lunch and dinner overlooking snow-capped peaks. SPA & Wellness Forget about time, between luxury and wellness at altitude. Activities Discover snowy and icy landscapes. Events Enchanting retreat facing the mountains. Restaurants & Bar Lunch and dinner overlooking snow-capped peaks. more information more information more information more information Book Follow us on instagram @lerefugedesolaise Located at the summit of Solaise, at an elevation of 2,551 meters, this extraordinary place overlooks the picturesque Val d'Isère in France. ACCESS Hotel +33 4 58 83 00 90 info@lerefuge-valdisere.com Spa +33 4 58 83 00 94 spa@lerefuge-valdisere.com Restaurant +33 4 58 83 00 91 restaurant@lerefuge-valdisere.com Press clara@pascalevenot.fr nastasia@pascalevenot.fr subscribe to the newsletter To receive invitations to our events and special offers, sign up for our newsletter. Thank you for your interest! Your application has been successful! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. Discover the Paris Society hotels GTC Terms and conditions privacy policy cookie policy PRESS FAQ FR EN 2022 - The Refuge Find us on Loading..."
