    "title": "Rooms & Apartments",
    "description": "The rooms of the luxury hotel le Refuge de Solaise in Val d'Isère are equipped with a decor and comfort that are rare at this altitude.",
    "text": "Rooms & Apartments Rooms & Apartments Restaurants & Bar Spa & Wellness Events Activities To offer To offer Access & Contact Membership winter SUMMER GTC Terms and conditions FAQ Find us on Menu winter SUMMER FR EN Book CLOSE Hotel Restaurant Spa Seminars Rooms & Apartments Staying at the Refuge de Solaise means enjoying a getaway in the heart of nature with all your senses, while staying nice and warm. ‍ The property features 16 rooms and suites, 4 apartments ranging from 75 to 380 m² (accommodating up to 18 people), and a cozy dormitory for families and groups of friends (up to 14 people). ‍ The decor is elegant and cozy, echoing the industrial atmosphere of the 1940s. Stone walls and local wood, chic furniture upholstered in wool, velvet, and leather, sunny terraces, and large picture windows overlooking the valley: the spirit of the place is warm, contemporary, and nature-oriented. ‍ ACCESS & INFORMATION In winter, access to Le Refuge de Solaise is only possible via the Solaise cable car, which departs from the foot of the slope and arrives 200 meters from the hotel at the top.<br>The cable car runs between 9 a.m. and 4:30 p.m. every day, and On Thursday, Friday and Saturday starting from 9 December 2023, the cable car is available exclusively for access to Le Refuge between 7 p.m. and 11 p.m. Rooms Flats The dormitory Thank you! Your submission has been received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. COMPETITION ROOMS 35 m² - 1 À 2 PerS Rooms ROOMS COMPETITION + 50 m² - 1 à 3 PerS Rooms WORLD CUP ROOMS 42 m² - 1 À 2 PerS Rooms WORLD CUP ROOMS + 58 m² - 1 À 4 PerS Rooms OLYMPIC ROOMS 68 m² - 1 À 5 PerS Rooms DANAIDS 74 m² - 4 PerS Flats GLACIER 160 m² - 12 PerS Flats MADELEINE 168 m² - 10 PerS Flats CHARVET 380 m² - 18 PerS Flats The Dormitory 70 m² - 14 PerS The dormitory Book Follow us on instagram @lerefugedesolaise Located at the summit of Solaise, at an elevation of 2,551 meters, this extraordinary place overlooks the picturesque