tch fabrics, reflects the authentic luxury of Fermes de Marie. Enjoy breathtaking views of the Alps from your terrace or balcony. The living area, integrated into the bedroom, can accommodate a child, and a baby bed is available on request. The bathroom with bath. Separate WC. See prices and availability Request for a quote Information and equipment Request for a quote EQUIPMENTS TV, free WiFi, bluetooth speaker, safe, Pure Altitude welcome products, Pure Altitude welcome products, hair dryer, minibar, Nespresso coffee machine, kettle and courtesy tray (choice of tea and infusions). Pets allowed. Duplex Family 50m² Up to 2 adults and 3 children 2 rooms Balcony Mountain view The Fermes de Marie duplex room is ideal for families, offering a large bed downstairs and a large bed on the mezzanine, as well as a sitting area to accommodate a third child with the possibility of a baby bed on request. Elegantly decorated in a mountain style, it offers a balcony with a view of the Rochebrune and Mont d'Arboi"
