    "url": "https://village-igloo.fr/en/overnight-stays-in-an-igloo/",
    "final": "https://village-igloo.fr/en/overnight-stays-in-an-igloo/",
    "title": "Sleep in an igloo",
    "description": "Spend an unforgettable night in an igloo! Live a unique experience between snow, adventure and magical atmosphere in the heart of the Alps.",
    "text": "Sleep in an igloo Skip to content Buy a gift voucher Booking Our igloos Igloo Avoriaz Igloo Les Arcs Igloo Val Thorens Igloo bar Dinner Night Events Blog Webcams FAQ Contact Our igloos Igloo Avoriaz Igloo Les Arcs Igloo Val Thorens Igloo bar Dinner Night Events Blog Webcams FAQ Contact A night to remember Sleep in an igloo Overnight Stay in the French Alps Les Arcs Avoriaz Val Thorens A unique experience in an igloo Spend a night in the heart of the mountains and discover the Village Igloo experience in Avoriaz, Les Arcs 2000 or Val Thorens . Settle into your room made entirely of snow and ice and wrap up in a polar expedition sleeping bag for a night like no other. The experience begins in the evening with a guided walk to the igloo . Once you arrive, enjoy a traditional Savoyard fondue in a spectacular world of snow and ice before heading to your room for the night. In the morning, enjoy breakfast in the heart of the igloo, one last moment in this extraordinary setting before returning to everyday life. from €249 for two Sleep in an igloo Your overnight stay in the mountains What to expect from your night in an Igloo An unforgettable gift Give a Village Igloo Experience Looking for an original gift? Give someone special a Village Igloo experience and surprise them with an unforgettable moment in the heart of the mountains . Whether it’s for a birthday, a special occasion or simply to make someone happy, choose a gift that will create lasting memories . Buy a gift voucher What happens during a night in the igloo? Our guide will meet you at 6:50 pm before accompanying you on foot to the igloo . Along the way, you’ll discover more about the resort and its mountain environment. Once you arrive, you’ll be welcomed with a drink before enjoying a traditional Savoyard fondue served with a selection of charcuterie. For the night, you’ll be provided with a polar expedition sleeping bag designed for temperatures as low as -25°C, helping you stay warm and comfortable throughout the night. A small 20 cl bottle of Pommery POP x Village Igloo champagne is also included, so you can raise a glass before heading to bed. The following morning, enjoy breakfast inside the igloo before walking back down with our guide at around 8 am. The departure takes place before the ski slopes open for safety reasons. Can I return to the resort after dinner? No. For safety reasons, guests are not allowed to travel on the ski slopes at night . Once you arrive at Village Igloo, you must remain on site until the guided departure the following morning. Can I bring a suitcase? No. As the igloo is accessed on foot, we recommend travelling light and leaving your luggage in your vehicle or storing it with a luggage storage or concierge service before your arrival. How to book our night? All overnight stays must be booked directly online through our booking platform . Advance booking is required to secure your stay. How many guests can stay overnight? Les Arcs and Val Thorens : 10 people"
   },
