al Thorens/Orelle ski area : a giant 180 m2 igloo entirely sculpted with snow and ice on the green slope of the Combe de Thorens. Live an unforgettable experience during the day or in the evening : themed ice cave, Ice Bar, fondue under igloo or even an unusual night! Without doubt the ideal place for a welldeserved break, whether you are a skier or a pedestrian. It is an atypical place that no one will leave ice! The Val Thorens Igloo Village in figures 3,500 m3 of snow 2,400 m altitude 180 m2 area 15 days of construction 0°C inside the igloo Opening periods of the Val Thorens Igloo Village The Val Thorens Igloo Village is open every day of the winter season, from mid-December to the end of the season, 7 days a week from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m. BONUS Open your eyes and look for the pirates-themed scuptures inside the ice caves ! ACTIVITIES OF VAL THORENS IGLOO VILLAGE Restaurant You will find these services only on Wednesday evenings at 7 p.m. and by reservation. —————————————————————————— Frosted aperi"
