   {
    "url": "https://village-igloo.fr/en/an-original-gift/",
    "final": "https://village-igloo.fr/en/an-original-gift/",
    "title": "An original gift - Village Igloo",
    "description": "Offer an original gift: a night or dinner in an igloo! A magical and unforgettable experience in the heart of the Alps.",
    "text": "An original gift - Village Igloo Skip to content Buy a gift voucher Booking Our igloos Igloo Avoriaz Igloo Les Arcs Igloo Val Thorens Igloo bar Dinner Night Events Blog Webcams FAQ Contact Our igloos Igloo Avoriaz Igloo Les Arcs Igloo Val Thorens Igloo bar Dinner Night Events Blog Webcams FAQ Contact Give an experience An original gift Looking for an original gift to surprise someone special? Give them a Village Igloo experience and let them discover a spectacular world made entirely of snow and ice, in the heart of the French Alps . A dinner over a traditional Savoyard fondue or a unique overnight stay in an igloo: choose the experience that suits them best and give them an unforgettable memory in Avoriaz, Les Arcs 2000 or Val Thorens. Give a dinner in an igloo Discover the dinner experience Village Igloo Les Arcs Giver a dinner in Les Arcs Discover this igloo Village Igloo Avoriaz Giver a dinner in Avoriaz Discover this igloo Village Igloo Val Thorens Giver a dinner in Val Thorens Discover this igloo Give an overnight stay in an igloo Discover the night experience Village Igloo Les Arcs Give an overnight stay in Les Arcs Discover this igloo Village Igloo Avoriaz Give an overnight stay in Avoriaz Discover this igloo Village Igloo Val Thorens Give an overnight stay in Val Thorens Discover this igloo How does a Village Igloo gift voucher work? 1. Choose the Experience Dinner or an overnight stay in an igloo. 2. Give Your Gift Voucher Receive your gift voucher by email, ready to give to someone special. 3. The Recipient Books Their Experience They choose their preferred date, subject to availability and the voucher’s validity conditions. 4. Head to Village Igloo! Make your way to Avoriaz, Les Arcs 2000 or Val Thorens and enjoy the experience. How long is a gift voucher valid? Your gift voucher is valid for the period indicated directly on the voucher. Make sure to book your experience before the expiry date. Do I need to choose a date when buying the gift voucher? No. You don’t need to choose a date when purchasing your gift voucher. The recipient can select their preferred date later, subject to availability. How to book my gift voucher? For an overnight stay: simply scan the QR code on the gift voucher or click the link provided to make a booking. For dinner: simply make a standard online reservation and present a copy of the gift voucher when paying on site. Can I give a Village Igloo experience to more than one person? Yes. Our gift experiences are available for different group sizes depending on the experience selected. Overnight stays, for example, can be purchased for 2, 3 or 4 guests. See the complete Q&A Contact +33 4 50 05 51 37 reservation@village-igloo.fr FAQ Everything you need to know about your Village Igloo experience Facebook-f Instagram Linkedin-in Tiktok perfume dupes . Payroll Processing . expense reporting software"
   },
