    "url": "https://village-igloo.fr/en/booking/",
    "final": "https://village-igloo.fr/en/booking/",
    "title": "Booking - Village Igloo",
    "description": "Book a typical Savoyard dinner or an unusual night in theone of our igloos villages in your stationsAvoriaz, Val Thorens and Les Arcs.",
    "text": "Booking - Village Igloo Skip to content Buy a gift voucher Booking Our igloos Igloo Avoriaz Igloo Les Arcs Igloo Val Thorens Igloo bar Dinner Night Events Blog Webcams FAQ Contact Our igloos Igloo Avoriaz Igloo Les Arcs Igloo Val Thorens Igloo bar Dinner Night Events Blog Webcams FAQ Contact Book your experience Choose your igloo Choose your Village Igloo and book your experience in Avoriaz, Les Arcs 2000 or Val Thorens . Enjoy a traditional Savoyard fondue or spend an unforgettable night in an igloo: choose your destination and start your Village Igloo experience. Village Igloo Les Arcs In the heart of the Paradiski ski area, discover Village Igloo Les Arcs 2000 and its spectacular ice gallery. Book my dinner Book my stay Discover this igloo Village Igloo Avoriaz In the heart of the Portes du Soleil, enjoy the Village Igloo experience in one of the French Alps’ most iconic ski resorts. Book my dinner Book my stay Discover this igloo Village Igloo Val Thorens At an altitude of 2,300 m, enjoy the Village Igloo experience in the heart of Les 3 Vallées, in Europe’s highest ski resort. Book my dinner Book my stay Discover this igloo Contact +33 4 50 05 51 37 reservation@village-igloo.fr FAQ Everything you need to know about your Village Igloo experience Facebook-f Instagram Linkedin-in Tiktok"
