    "title": "Cour des Loges · Restaurant in Vieux Lyon · 5th Arrondissement",
    "description": "OFFICIAL · Discover the Restaurants of Cour des Loges in Vieux-Lyon ✓ 1 Michelin Star Gastronomic Restaurant ✓ Bar Lounge ✓ 5th Arrondissement ✓ Chef Anthony Bonnet",
    "text": "Cour des Loges · Restaurant in Vieux Lyon · 5th Arrondissement Menu English Français Offer a Gift Box Book Online Fermer English Français Offer a Gift Box Book Online Home The Story of Cour des Loges Gastronomic Restaurant - Les Loges* Restaurant Bistronomic - Le Comptoir Bar Lounge Breakfast in the Grand Cour Photo & Video Gallery Accessibility Press Contact Us Fermer Book a Table at Les Loges* a Table at Le Comptoir Book a Room History Cour des Loges Lyon, the first Radisson Collection Hotel in France, enjoys an extraordinary geographical location. This Renaissance jewel is situated in one of the most beautiful cities in the world, renowned for being the capital of gastronomy. The 5-star hotel dating from the 14th century tells a story: that of Vieux Lyon, its traboules and its silk workers—a maze of courtyards, corridors, and staircases where it was easy to get lost and disappear. Cour des Loges offers 61 unique, fully renovated rooms and suites that invite you to journey. An experience worthy of the Radisson Collection, where the elegance and comfort of contemporary lifestyle combine with the historic charm of this building in a district listed as a UNESCO World Heritage site. Staying at Cour des Loges Lyon, A Radisson Collection Hotel ensures you a unique experience, both through the quality of its hospitality and the culinary journey in its gastronomic restaurant located in the iconic district of Vieux-Lyon. You can rely on a team of hosts, receptionists, porters, and Clefs d'Or concierges who excel in the art of French hospitality. The restaurants of Cour des Loges in Lyon In the Vieux-Lyon district, renowned for its friendly atmosphere and its traboules (hidden passageways), you can discover the comfort of a 5-star hotel and enjoy a remarkable sensory experience at its gastronomic restaurant, Les Loges, or its bistronomic restaurant, Le Comptoir. Open to both hotel guests and external visitors, the gastronomic restaurant Les Loges, the Comptoir, and the Lounge Bar, orchestrated by Chef Anthony Bonnet, invite you to experience timeless moments within this elegant 5-star hotel. Social média facebook instagram Adresse 6 rue du Boeuf 69005 Lyon FRANCE Nous contacter +33472774446 info.lyon@radissoncollection.com Réservation Book a Table at Le Comptoir Book a Table at Les Loges Book a Room DESIGN CELINE CASTAGNET/API & YOU AND SEO WWW.API-AND-YOU.COM - ｢∫｣ OFFICIAL WEBSITE - Mentions légales - Confidentialité - Gestion des cookies Offer a Gift Box Book Online"
