    "title": "Château de la Resle, Design Hotel Auxerre and Spa by Codage",
    "description": "Château de la Resle, member of Design Hotel with 10 rooms, restaurant, pool, a Spa by Codage, sauna and hammam between Chablis and Auxerre.",
    "text": "Château de la Resle, Design Hotel Auxerre and Spa by Codage Skip to content Menu Français English Rooms Chablis Irancy Montigny Saint Bris Vezelay Fontenay Gastronomy Wellness Events Private events Professionnal events Experiences Around Château de la Resle At the Château Our Themed Stays Offer English Français Book now Home Our Art & Design Collection Rooms & Suites Chablis Irancy Montigny Saint Bris Vezelay Fontenay OUR RESTAURANT “LA TABLE DE LA RESLE” Wellness & Swimming Pool Experiences Around Château de la Resle At the Château Our Themed Stays Our commitment Contact Location FAQs Offer fr en Book your experience Relaxation | Art & Design | Nature OFF THE BEATEN TRACK Relaxation | Art & Design | Nature OFF THE BEATEN TRACK Relaxation | Art & Design | Nature OFF THE BEATEN TRACK ← → Check in Check out Check in Check out Adults 1 2 Children 0 1 2 Promo Code Book your experience Best Rate guaranteed Home away from home Château de la Resle Château de la Resle | member of Design Hotels near Chablis in Burgundy: a unique location where classic architecture meets contemporary art. Rather than trying to tick all the boxes of a traditional hotel, we are simply opening our domain in order to share it with you for a couple of days. No bell boys or night guardians around but rather a dedicated team that is passionate about the Château and its region who hand you the keys. We aim to offer you a great experience with a maximum of privacy and intimacy in an authentic and charming atmosphere. Welcome to the Château! A collectors home Architecture | Art | Design Since 2005 the Château has continuously collected period furniture purchased in auctions, contemporary works of art spotted in galleries and design discovered in the workshops of young talents. The greatest challenge has always been to create a world that is both surprising and harmonious. A space where classical elements and modern design enhance each other, where Burgundy architecture and contemporary art come together. Destination Burgundy Vineyards | Heritage | Canals Located between the vineyards of Chablis and the regional capital Auxerre with its historic city centre, Château de la Resle is the ideal spot for a getaway in a beautiful landscape. Less than two hours from Paris, you enter another world as soon as you approach the Château; a well preserved part of Burgundy with all the benefits of the countryside. We are located close to the vineyards of Chablis and in the birthplace of Cistercian architecture, all set against a backdrop of canals, hills and forests. More photos Commitment to our planet Responsibility | Luxury At Château de la Resle, we’re continually working to reduce our environmental impact while safeguarding the estate, its surroundings, and its people. During your stay, this translates into practical choices: purified water is provided to eliminate single-use plastics, and our sourcing prioritises local and organic producers. At our estate, you will appreciate regional artist"
   },
