    "text": "Our Fontenay suites at Château de la Resle Skip to content Menu Français English Rooms Chablis Irancy Montigny Saint Bris Vezelay Fontenay Gastronomy Wellness Events Private events Professionnal events Experiences Around Château de la Resle At the Château Our Themed Stays Offer English Français Book now Home Our Art & Design Collection Rooms & Suites Chablis Irancy Montigny Saint Bris Vezelay Fontenay OUR RESTAURANT “LA TABLE DE LA RESLE” Wellness & Swimming Pool Experiences Around Château de la Resle At the Château Our Themed Stays Our commitment Contact Location FAQs Offer fr en Book your experience ← → Home Discover & Reserve online Fontenay Fontenay Superior Suite with bathtub Fontenay, our favourite historical location in the region. They are also our favourite suites (75 m2 across two floors), located in the former Château farm. The building lends itself perfectly to an urban loft style. The two floors are connected by a spectacular spiral staircase. On the ground floor you will enjoy a beautiful living room. The large bedroom with its open bathroom is upstairs. The view of the pool will make you feel like you are in a Mediterranean destination. Book now Max occupancy 2 persons Breakfast Included Bed types Kingsize 180×200 Surface 75 m2 Room features Alongside the pool Duplex Living room with armachair and sofa Opened bathroom Double glazed windows Desk Non-smoking Organic coffee & tea Waste separation bin Digital safe Equipments Minibar Nespresso machine Kettle Free wifi Air-conditioning Fan Marshall speaker Heating floor Laundry steamer Bathroom features Rain shower Bathtub Double washbasin Toilet Bidet Bathrobe Eco-slippers Hair dryer Magnifying mirror Sustainable amenities products Our goal will always be to make you feel at home. Breakfast is included in the room rate and use of the pool, spa and gym is also included throughout your stay. ← → Our other rooms Standard Room Chablis Our latest renovation is the Chablis room in the main building of the Château. This… More info Book now Superior Room Irancy Our two Irancy rooms in the main building of the Château offer an extremely comfortable… More info Book now Junior suite Montigny Our most recent renovation is the creation of the Montigny suite in the attic of… More info Book now Junior Suite with kitchen Saint Bris Saint Bris; “the other” white wine from the region and also the name of our… More info Book now Junior Suite with kitchen Vezelay The Vezelay suites (50 m2 over two floors) were added to our collection of rooms… More info Book now Lieu dit La Resle , Montigny la Resle , 89230 , France Phone +33 (0) 6 86 11 29 22 info@chateaudelaresle.com events@chateaudelaresle.com © Copyright Château de la Resle 2026 Where we are Please contact us FAQs Legal notice Cookie management Sitemap Credits"
