    "description": "OFFICIAL WEBSITE | Stay at Auberge Saint-Pierre, a 3-star hotel and restaurant in the heart of Mont Saint-Michel. Charming rooms and the best rate guaranteed.",
    "text": "Charming 3-star hotel, Mont Saint-Michel - Auberge Saint-Pierre Booking Best prices guaranteed Book your stay Arrival date Departure date Number of nights Adult(s) Date Month Year Child/Children Age child 1 Age child 2 Age child 3 Age child 4 Age child 5 Age child 6 Age child 7 Age child 8 Age child 9 Age child 10 Options Book News See our News Offer a gift box Homepage Photo gallery News The rooms at the Inn The Logis rooms Restaurant À La Carte and Set Menus Seminars Panoramic visit Location & Access Mont Saint-Michel Rates & Information Employement offers Gift Boxes Find out more Close twin room front terrace auberge-saint-pierre-Mont-Saint-Michel 1 / A Historical Home A family affair The Auberge Saint Pierre is right in the heart of Mont Saint Michel, protected by the ramparts, along the small street that leads to the abbey. This 15th-century wood-framed house is a registered historical monument. The inn will transport you back to the Middle Ages. For generations, the Leroy and Gaulois family has been hosting guests in the tradition of French inns. You'll be greeted with a smile, attentive service and an authentic setting here. The enchanting setting at the Auberge Saint Pierre is like a breath of fresh air. Daydream in this place full of history. Book your room Services and amenities The Auberge Saint-Pierre is in the heart of a medieval village 23 rooms hotel on 3 seperate historic buildings Restaurant serving traditional cuisine and menus showcasing local specialities, including the famous Mont Saint Michel omelette. Free WiFi connection Baby welcome upon request with high chairs, bottle warmers, cribs, and changing mats Languages spoken: English, Italian, Spanish Group hosting and seminar planning Event planning for family meals, parties, birthdays . . Pooling of services between the Auberge Saint Pierre, La Croix Blanche and La Vieille Auberge: reception, independent entrance accessible by the ramparts, secure luggage storage, License IV bar an