    "text": "The Bordeaux vineyard - Bordeaux Wine Trip - The irresistible vineyard Gironde Tourism Discover See more return Gironde by bike The Bordeaux vineyard Our destinations Arcachon Bay Blaye - Bourg - Terres d'Estuaire Bordeaux Entre-deux-Mers Medoc Saint-Emilion, Libourne, Fronsac South Gironde Cultural Heritage Nature and ecotourism Gastronomy Blog On site See more return The Gironde on foot Children's corner Accommodations Motorhome areas Campsites Guest rooms Eco-labeled accommodation Collective accommodation Hotels Holiday rentals Holiday Villages and Tourist Residences Tourisme & Handicap Outdoor activities The Gironde by boat Good deals Gironde Practical See more return Kiosk Tourist offices Events The weekend agenda The vineyard agenda Exhibitions Markets Christmas markets Pink October Open doors Shows & concerts Harvest Visits Coming to Gironde Getting around in Gironde Weather Behind the scenes of the Gironde Partners' area Getting around I research Weather Contact us Kiosk I research Weather Getting around The Bordeaux vineyard Contact us Kiosk en Menu Discover The Bordeaux vineyard Home Discover the Bordeaux vineyards The Bordeaux Vineyards: Land of \"Good Adventure\" Welcome to the heart of Vineyards & Discoveries , the ultimate experience for discovering the Bordeaux vineyards in a new way. Here, we invite you to leave the clock behind and embrace slow tourism. Whether you're a connoisseur of prestigious classified growths or curious about hidden gems, the Gironde opens the doors to its six wine routes for a stay rich in encounters and emotions. TO EXPERIENCE THE VINEYARD, VISIT BORDEAUX.COM Tastings & Expertise Meet passionate winemakers at our Vignobles & Découvertes certified estates. From elegance to magic, experience authentic tastings where people and terroir are one. Expert tip: Don't miss the blending workshops to create your own wine! Activities & Travel Explore the vineyards at your own pace. Hop on your bike to discover our local routes, set off with your family following the Terra Aventura trails, or enjoy a yoga break amidst the vines. Here, every path promises sustainable discovery, accessible to all. Charming Accommodations Extend your experience by staying right next to the vineyards. From charming bed and breakfasts to rural cottages and prestigious hotels, our selection of accommodations guarantees comfort and total immersion for a serene and gourmet getaway. A vineyard to live Discover a terroir at the top of a tree, go on a treasure hunt in the heart of the vineyards, visit the most breathtaking cellars, discover the profession of cooper, enjoy a banquet in the vineyards or simply go for a bike ride in through Bordeaux and its vineyards, you dreamed of it? With friends, alone or with family, the Bordeaux vineyards are an invitation to travel and the promise of a unique parenthesis. Accommodation in the Bordeaux vineyards Activities in the Bordeaux vineyards Restaurants and Wine Bar Wine tastings, wine estates, cellars o"
