    "final": "https://www.casadelmar.fr/en",
    "title": "Luxury Hotel in Porto-Vecchio, Corsica | Hôtel Casadelmar",
    "description": "Discover Casadelmar, a 5-star haven in Porto-Vecchio with sea-view rooms, a 2-Michelin-star restaurant and a myBlend spa. Book your Corsican escape today.",
    "text": "Luxury Hotel in Porto-Vecchio, Corsica | Hôtel Casadelmar Hotel Rooms & Suites Superior Double Room Executive Double Room Luxury Double Room Superior Junior Suite Luxury Junior Suite Superior Suite Executive Suite Luxury Suite Private Villa Restaurants Casadelmar Il Pontile Brunch Spa & Wellbeing Services Events Gift Vouchers Contact 04 95 72 34 34 Book Rooms & Suites CasadelMar ** Il Pontile Spa fr en CASADELMAR The quintessence of Mediterranean living Suspended between sky and sea, Casadelmar is one of those rare places where time seems to stand still. Anchored on a hillside, a ship of wood and glass forever ready to set sail on immobile voyages through an eternal summer. Confidential and refined, Casadelmar interprets Mediterranean living with modernity, blending a thousand-year-old art of life with contemporary vision. Radical and sensual, its architecture elevates light itself, within a mineral and plant-filled sanctuary generously open to the Gulf of Porto-Vecchio. Daring and unique in Corsica, Casadelmar is a haven of serenity. One comes here to regenerate during an intimate interlude. Book Suspended between sky and sea, Casadelmar is one of those rare places where time seems to stand still. Anchored on a hillside, a ship of wood and glass forever ready to set sail on immobile voyages through an eternal summer. Confidential and refined, Casadelmar interprets Mediterranean living with modernity, blending a thousand-year-old art of life with contemporary vision. Radical and sensual, its architecture elevates light itself, within a mineral and plant-filled sanctuary generously open to the Gulf of Porto-Vecchio. Daring and unique in Corsica, Casadelmar is a haven of serenity. One comes here to regenerate during an intimate interlude. Casadelmar, luxury in all discretion Both luxurious and intimate, Casadelmar is a unique luxury hotel in Corsica. Nestled with feet in the water, near the town centre and the most beautiful beaches of Porto-Vecchio, this exceptional home set within a lush 3-hectare garden designed by Jean Mus is a haven of peace in pristine nature. Its contemporary architecture signed by Jean-François Bodin blurs the boundaries between landscape and interior spaces, making light a material in its own right. Discover Book Luxury Rooms and Suites Spacious rooms with terrace and sea view The hotel's 34 rooms and suites offer rare luxury: all feature generous volumes from 35 to 75 sqm, are fully open to the sea and extended by vast terraces. Superior Double Room 35 sqm - Sea view - 15 sqm terrace Executive Double Room 41 sqm - Sea view - 15 sqm terrace Luxury Double Room 48 sqm - Sea view - 15 sqm terrace Superior Junior Suite 45 sqm - sea view - 30 sqm terrace JuniorLuxury Suite 53 sqm - Sea view - 30 sqm terrace SuperiorSuite 62 sqm - Sea view - 30 sqm terrace ExecutiveSuite 62 sqm - Sea View - 30 sqm terrace LuxurySuite 75 sqm - Sea view - 30 sqm terrace Superior Double Room 35 sqm - Sea view - 15 sqm terrace Executive Double Room "
