    "description": "Discover 34 sea-view rooms and suites with private terraces up to 30 sqm, designed by Jean-François Bodin. Book your stay at Hôtel Casadelmar today.",
    "text": "Rooms & Suites, Sea View Terraces | Hôtel Casadelmar Hotel Rooms & Suites Superior Double Room Executive Double Room Luxury Double Room Superior Junior Suite Luxury Junior Suite Superior Suite Executive Suite Luxury Suite Private Villa Restaurants Casadelmar Il Pontile Brunch Spa & Wellbeing Services Events Gift Vouchers Contact 04 95 72 34 34 Book Rooms & Suites CasadelMar ** Il Pontile Spa fr en The sea as horizon Bathed in light, facing the sea and extended by vast terraces, the 34 spacious rooms and suites cultivate simplicity as an art form. Designed by architect Jean-François Bodin, they celebrate noble materials. Light wood, Bateig stone, subtle-toned drapes that filter the light compose a soothing cocoon where one restores oneself. Casadelmar offers connecting rooms and suites for a bespoke stay in complete intimacy, for two or as a family. Bathed in light, facing the sea and extended by vast terraces, the 34 spacious rooms and suites cultivate simplicity as an art form. Designed by architect Jean-François Bodin, they celebrate noble materials. Light wood, Bateig stone, subtle-toned drapes that filter the light compose a soothing cocoon where one restores oneself. Casadelmar offers connecting rooms and suites for a bespoke stay in complete intimacy, for two or as a family. Superior Double Room 35 sqm - Sea view - 15 sqm terrace Ideal for a stay for two, this spacious, comfortable cocoon remarkably well-equipped offers a panoramic 15 sqm terrace to fully enjoy the view, a King Size bed, a bathroom with shower and bathtub. For a family stay, certain connecting rooms can be linked to a suite. View the plan Book Equipment Panoramic sea-view terrace 180 cm bed Bathroom with shower and bathtub Separate toilet Possibility of connection with a suite Flat-screen TV satellite Canal+ Telephone DVD player IPod station Wi-Fi access Air conditioning/heating with individual adjustment Safe Nespresso coffee machine Kettle Minibar Room compliant with accessibility standards Executive Double Room 41 sqm - Sea view - 15 sqm terrace More spacious, always furnished in light and luminous tones, the Executive Double Room embodies the Casadelmar spirit with a terrace open to the sea, comfortable living spaces, a King Size bed and numerous amenities. View the plan Book Equipment Panoramic sea-view terrace 180 cm bed Bathroom with shower and bathtub Separate toilet Possibility of connection with a suite Flat-screen TV satellite Canal+ Telephone DVD player IPod station Wi-Fi access Air conditioning/heating with individual adjustment Safe Nespresso coffee machine Kettle Minibar Luxury Double Room 48 sqm - Sea view - 15 sqm terrace At Casadelmar, luxury is first and foremost space. This 48 sqm connecting room open onto a 15 sqm sea-view terrace is the most spacious of the three categories of Double Rooms at the hotel. View the plan Book Equipment Panoramic sea-view terrace 180 cm bed 180 cm bed Bathroom with shower and bathtub Separate toilet Possibility of connectio"
