    "text": "Refuge du Montenvers | Hotel in Chamonix Mer de Glace | Terminal Neige Hotels 🌸 Spring Offer: 15% off your stay with the code SPRING26 · Valid through April 13, 2026 → Book now Menu Close Rooms Hotel Restaurants Your event Gifts MER DE GLACE NEWS & OFFERS access & contact GALLERY CAREER FR EN Le Refuge du Montenvers Rooms Sea of Ice Hotel Gifts Restaurants Your event News & Offers Gallery Career WEDDINGS & EVENTS FR EN Thank you! Your submission has been received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. BOOK DIRECT AND GET THE BEST AVAILABLE RATE! Flexible rates Unique special offers Real time availability Secure transaction Concierge Service Best rate guaranteed Telephone service 7 days a week Sanitary measures Flexible rates Rooms & Suite A journey into the past, a tribute to the architectural and historical heritage of Montenvers, which has been witness to the greatest mountain climbers, adventurers, famous artists and writers. DISCOVER Restaurant with view Discover our restaurant, the mythical Restaurant du Montenvers in the historic hotel. And our Bar des Glaciers, for a gourmet break facing the Mer de Glace. DISCOVER News & Experiences experiences The little rack train of the Mer de Glace Since 1908, summer and winter, the traditional red railroad is still the preferred way to discover the Mer de Glace. read more Around Montenvers Hiking around the Refuge Discover hikes to the hotel and around the Montenvers site read more Around Montenvers Little Red Train to the Sea of Ice Since 1908, summer and winter, the traditional red rail remains the privileged way for everyone to discover the Mer de Glace. It remains one of the major attractions of the Chamonix valley. The charming mountain village would not be quite the same without it. ‍ read more Our events Your seminar at altitude! An exceptional and unique seminar at an altitude of 1913m. Agencies and companies who trust us for all their events! read more Around Montenvers Ice Cave It was in 1992 that the two high mountain guides, Bruno Gardent and Bernard Lambolez, passed the Mer de Glace cave on their way back from the Drus. read more Offers Romantic evening For a romantic evening, choose our personalized formula to surprise your half! read more Offers Lift pass Buy in advance online your summer / winter lift tickets to access the different ski areas read more The Best Mont-Blanc Group Follow us on the networks! Visit our Facebook and Instagram pages to discover our hotel and its playground! read more The Best Mont-Blanc Group Best Mont-Blanc group hotels read more The Best Mont-Blanc Group Refuge du Montenvers accepts ANCV vacation vouchers ANCV vacation vouchers are accepted at Refuge du Montenvers and all Best Mont-Blanc hotels! read more Press Houses & Hotels of legend Dive into the heart of the Refuge and its breathtaking environment by watching the program Maisons & Hôtels de Légende broadcast on France 2. read more read more La Mer de Glace Legendary for its history, mag"
