    "text": "Refuge du Montenvers | Chamonix 🌸 Spring Offer: 15% off your stay with the code SPRING26 · Valid through April 13, 2026 → Book now Menu Close Rooms Hotel Restaurants Your event Gifts MER DE GLACE NEWS & OFFERS access & contact GALLERY CAREER FR EN Le Refuge du Montenvers Request to be called back Need help to book your stay ? Contact us at +33 4 50 91 48 59 or request to be called back : The nature of your request: Booking Department First Choice Second Choice Third Choice Your Personal Details : When would you like to be called back: Time Slot 8am - 10am 10am - 12am 14pm - 16pm 16pm - 18pm Time Zone: GMT / UTC GMT UTC Thank you! Your submission has been received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. In accordance with the \"Data protection act\", you have the right to access and rectify data concerning you, and to oppose their processing. To know more about it here Rooms Sea of Ice Hotel Gifts Restaurants Your event News & Offers Gallery Career WEDDINGS & EVENTS FR EN Sleeping in a high mountain refuge The Refuge du Montenvers offers you the charm of yesteryear in its 18 rooms and suites. A journey into the past to pay homage to Montenvers, an architectural and historical heritage that has seen the greatest mountaineers, adventurers, famous artists and writers come and go. If the walls could talk, many secrets would be told about the history of this great building. NEWS, AGENDA & EXPERIENCES The Refuge Spirit AT LA MER DE GRACE To go to the Refuge du Montenvers, a 30 minutes trip aboard the little red train is waiting for you. Destination: 1913 m altitude at the foot of the famous Mer de Glace. You will find in this refuge Made in Mont Blanc a deliciously old atmosphere, a place of sharing, authenticity and homecoming! A LIVING LEGEND Built in 1880 to accommodate the first mountaineers and travelers who came to visit the Mer de Glace, it displays a sober granite façade, dotted by many small windows. After a renovation, the historical charm of the site, as well as the \"refuge\" spirit seep into the unconscious of each visitor under the name Refuge du Montenvers: inviting a place of sharing, authenticity and homecoming. Romantic getaway in altitude If you've always dreamt of having a mountain all to yourself and adding a little sparkle to your life, then take your other-half on a passionate mountain-top escapade or celebrate a totally unique honeymoon here. The destination is sure to surprise. Perched high up in the mountains, you discover the famous Mer de Glace and its Ice Cave. The dream continues at this intimate refuge imbued with tranquillity and serenity. Digital Detox MOUNTAIN SPIRIT WITH SOUL When here, having the right to switch off is no special favour. You are invited to put your smartphone to one side and replace it with books and board games while on a digital detox break. At this stylish refuge, isolated from the rest of the world, you put down your digital devices and unwind in a pixel-free environment. With its pictu"
