  "pages": [
   {
    "url": "https://www.refugechezlatante.com/en",
    "final": "https://www.refugechezlatante.com/en",
    "title": "Refuge Chez la Tante | Hotel Spa on the Slopes of Saint Gervais",
    "description": "Discover our mountain hotel, restaurant, and spa, on the Megève slopes. Enjoy a wellness stay in the Alps with a swimming pool.",
    "text": "Refuge Chez la Tante | Hotel Spa on the Slopes of Saint Gervais Get ready for winter now ❄️ Plan your stay at Refuge Chez La Tante and enjoy 20% off your half-board room when booking at least 14 days before your arrival . Minimum 2-night stay. Non-cancellable and non-refundable offer, valid all winter excluding the period from December 29, 2026, to January 1, 2027, inclusive. ‍ Book my stay Contact us Thanks! Your quote has been successfully received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. Receiving our newsletter Thanks! Your quote has been successfully received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. ROOMS Restaurant Spa EXPÉRIENCES Activités été Activités hiver Events Wedding Contact & Access GALLERY en fr en es BOOK A TABLE BOOK A ROOM Where time stops The fire is crackling, time is fading away, and only the present moment counts Follow the star, find the refuge Up there, everything becomes simple: A fire, a meal, faces, and the silence of the peaks A unique mountain refuge in the heart of the Alps Ski-in ski-out hotel in Saint-Gervais - Megève to experience the mountains differently The Refuge Chez La Tante - Mont d'Arbois is not a hotel like the others: it is a suspended interlude between sky and peaks, a confidential place where you can rediscover the mountain in its purest state. Accessible only by cable car or ski and open in winter and summer, it offers its guests the invaluable privilege of sleeping where the slopes end, and waking up alone, facing the immensity. When the last skier comes back down, the mountain regains its calm. Silence sets in, the light changes, and the Refuge becomes your world. Here, the experience is total: sharing a drink by the fire, admiring the ballet of the stars through the large windows, or simply feeling the luxury of time slowing down. Staying at the Refuge Chez La Tante - Mont d'Arbois means accepting a rare disconnection, far from the hustle and bustle of the valleys, in a cozy atmosphere where sincere hospitality and discreet refinement meet to create unforgettable memories. book an unusual stay Charming rooms and suites on the slopes An intimate mountain hotel With only twenty rooms, the Refuge Chez La Tante - Mont d'Arbois has chosen privacy and personalization. Here, each room has been designed as a cocoon, where noble materials, light tones and light effects create a warm and soothing atmosphere. From the window or the balcony, the mountain invites itself like a living picture: snowy peaks, a flamboyant sunrise, or the pristine calm of the slopes that are still asleep. Modern comfort blends with Alpine charm to offer an ideal setting for rest and rejuvenation. ‍ In the morning, you have the ultimate privilege: put on your skis and trace the first curves on virgin snow, long before the resort awakens. A rare, almost secret moment that makes each stay an unforgettable experience. Rooms Mountain restaurant Chez la Tante The art of sharing around the fire Chez la Tante, a"
   },
   {
    "url": "https://www.megeve-tourisme.fr/en/hotel/refuge-chez-la-tante-mont-darbois/",
    "final": "https://www.megeve-tourisme.fr/en/hotel/refuge-chez-la-tante-mont-darbois/",
    "title": "Refuge Chez la Tante - Mont d'Arbois in Saint-Gervais-les-Bains - Megève Tourism",
    "description": "At an altitude of 1850m, this establishment with its unique concept, somewhere between a hotel and a mountain refuge, is accessible by gondola lift. It features 20 rooms, a penthouse suite, a swimming pool, spa, bowling alley, and a restaurant with panoramic views of Mont Blanc.",
    "text": "Refuge Chez la Tante - Mont d'Arbois in Saint-Gervais-les-Bains - Megève Tourism Skip to content Open the menu Discover See more Previous Discover Village of Megève Gastronomy Facilities Blog To ski See more Previous To ski Winter sports Ski station Package purchases Family skiing Ski schools Equipment rental Activities See more Previous Activities Outdoor Indoor Well-being & relaxation Aquatic Culture & Discovery aerial Restaurants & Nightlife Plan my stay See more Previous Plan my stay Accommodations Access and mobility Accessible station Family resort Practical Info See more Previous Practical Info Live news Our booklets Megève mobile app Our commitments Shops & services Webcams Weather Events FR FR Open the search bar Events Live Home / Refuge Chez la Tante – Mont d’Arbois 5 stars Hotel restaurant à Saint-Gervais-les-Bains Refuge Chez la Tante – Mont d'Arbois Photo 1 more photos Photo 2 Photo 3 Photo 4 Show more pictures Photo 5 Photo 6 Photo 7 Photo 8 Photo 9 Photo 10 Share on … About Us Capacity Opening Prices Services At an altitude of 1850m, this establishment with its unique concept, somewhere between a hotel and a mountain refuge, is accessible by gondola lift. It features 20 rooms, a penthouse suite, a swimming pool, spa, bowling alley, and a restaurant with panoramic views of Mont Blanc. Designed as a warm, elegant and intimate retreat, Le Refuge Chez la Tante – Mont d'Arbois revisits the spirit of old mountain refuges, bringing the refinement of a high-end hotel. Solid wood, felt fabrics, natural colors, and carefully selected vintage objects create a soft and enveloping atmosphere, perfect for rest and relaxation. Here, every detail has been carefully considered to recreate a feeling of being cocooned at the summit, in the spirit of a lived-in home rather than a traditional hotel. From the moment you arrive by cable car, the experience begins: that of a place outside the world, where silence, light, and landscapes contribute to a true inner transformation. A rare sensory experience, reserved for a select few. We speak: English, French Does the Refuge Chez la Tante – Mont d'Arbois establishment accept animals? No, animals are not allowed at the Refuge Chez la Tante – Mont d'Arbois. Certifications & Labels 5 stars See more Location details Mountain view In the mountains Isolated Ski station Accessible on skis Panoramic view Accessible to pedestrians Capacity Types of accommodation Altitude chalet Recent construction Opening To view the different information, you can use the navigation arrows placed to the right of the painting. Opening hours from December 19, 2026 to April 05, 2027 Monday Open Tuesday Open Wednesday Open Thursday Open Friday Open Saturday Open Sunday Open Opening hours from June 26 to August 31, 2027 Monday Open Tuesday Open Wednesday Open Thursday Open Friday Open Saturday Open Sunday Open Clear periods: From 19/12/2026 to 05/04/2027, every day. From 26/06 to 31/08/2027, every day. Prices Prices Min. Max. Half board "
   },
   {
    "url": "https://club.yonder.fr/le-refuge-chez-la-tante-mont-d-arbois/",
    "final": "https://club.yonder.fr/le-refuge-chez-la-tante-mont-d-arbois/",
    "title": "Le Refuge Chez la Tante - Hôtel spa 4 ★ - Restaurant bistronomique - Club Yonder",
    "description": "Réservez Le Refuge Chez la Tante , Hôtel spa 4 ★ - Restaurant bistronomique à Saint-Gervais/Megève - Haute savoie : jusqu'à -25% avec le Club Yonder. Hôtel avec restaurant, Hôtel Spa, Week-end à la Montagne, Week-end au ski",
    "text": "Le Refuge Chez la Tante - Hôtel spa 4 ★ - Restaurant bistronomique - Club Yonder --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> --> Skip to content Les plus beaux hôtels Réserver Destinations Carte France Rhône-Alpes Lyon Isère Haute Savoie Évian-les-Bains Megève Savoie Alsace Colmar Strasbourg Nouvelle Aquitaine Bordeaux Île de Ré Bourgogne Bretagne Champagne Corse Côte d’Azur Franche-Comté Île de France Occitanie Nord Normandie Deauville Paris Pays de Loire Provence Vallée de la Loire Europe Belgique Espagne Grèce Hongrie Italie Luxembourg Portugal Royaume-Uni Suisse Antilles françaises Saint Barthélemy Brésil Île Maurice Maroc Marrakech Vietnam Expériences Dormir dans un château City Break Vacances en famille Hôtel avec piscine Hôtel Spa Restaurant gastronomique Week-end en amoureux Hôtel à la campagne Hôtel bord de mer Dormir dans une cabane Plus d’expériences Types d’hôtels Boutique hôtels Hôtels 3 étoiles Hôtels 4 étoiles Hôtels 5 étoiles Palaces Hôtels Design Villas Privées Appartements de luxe Cabanes Lodges Maisons d’hôtes Relais & Châteaux Leading Hôtels of the World Small Luxury Hôtels Le club, c’est quoi? Nos coups de coeur Carnet d’inspirations Menu Type and press enter to search Accueil » Le Refuge Chez la Tante refuge-chez-la-tante-suite-arbois-8_54892449844_l 6908dac237ab27b091b9046a_REGUGE-CHEZ-LA-TANTE-SAINT-GERVAIS-MEGEVE (25)-p-2000 Saint-Gervais/Megève - Haute savoie Le Refuge Chez la Tante Hôtel spa 4 ★ - Restaurant bistronomique Jusqu'à -25% Réservez cet hôtel Pour qui ? Pour les voyageurs en quête d’une retraite intimiste perchée au-dessus des nuages, où l’esprit refuge rencontre le raffinement discret de l’hôtellerie haut de gamme. Le pitch Suspendu à 1 850 m d’altitude, accessible uniquement par télécabine, Le Refuge Chez La Tante – Mont d’Arbois est une adresse rare, à mi-chemin entre le refuge de montagne et l’hôtel confidentiel. À l’intérieur, bois massif, tissus naturels, objets chinés et lumière douce composent un décor chaleureux où l’on se sent immédiatement « chez soi ». Les 20 chambres et la suite penthouse se déploient comme des cocons, offrant une vue imprenable sur les sommets et une atmosphère enveloppante, propice à la déconnexion. Le Refuge vit au rythme de la montagne. Au déjeuner, la table Chez La Tante rend hommage à la cuisine alpine : viandes grillées à la braise, plats mijotés au feu de bois, desserts réconfortants… Le soir, seuls les hôtes du refuge y ont accès, pour un dîner exclusif au coin du feu ou sur la terrasse panoramique face au Mont-Blanc. Le bar, animé tout au long de la journée, devient à la nuit tombée un salon feutré où l’on savoure un vin chaud aux épices ou un cocktail signature. L’expérience se prolonge au spa, où piscine intérieure, hammam et soins sur mesure invitent à une détente absolue. Nous aimons L’accès unique par télécabine, qui rend chaque arrivée déjà magique. Le silence, la lumière, la sensation de déconnexion absolue au cœur des "
