    "url": "https://www.refugechezlatante.com/en/rooms",
    "final": "https://www.refugechezlatante.com/en/rooms",
    "title": "Our Rooms & Suites in the Mountains | Refuge Chez la Tante",
    "description": "Stay in our cozy rooms and suites in Saint Gervais-Megève. Enjoy views of the slopes, an alpine atmosphere, and the comfort of a spa hotel in Haute Savoie.",
    "text": "Our Rooms & Suites in the Mountains | Refuge Chez la Tante Contact us Thanks! Your quote has been successfully received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. Receiving our newsletter Thanks! Your quote has been successfully received! Oops! Something went wrong while submitting the form. ROOMS Restaurant Spa EXPÉRIENCES Activités été Activités hiver Events Wedding Contact & Access GALLERY en fr en es BOOK A TABLE BOOK A ROOM A night under the stars A hotel at altitude where each room becomes a cocoon Sleeping at the top: a unique experience at altitude Hotel rooms on the slopes of Saint-Gervais - Megève Staying at Refuge Chez La Tante - Mont d’Arbois is a rare privilege: spending the night closer to the stars, in the heart of a mountain that regains its original calm once the slopes have closed. Here, silence and vastness become your companions for the night. ‍ Each room has been designed as a cozy cocoon where wood, wool, and fine materials wrap your mountain evenings in comfort. As night falls, the crackling fire, the comfort of a plush bed, and the serenity of the surroundings turn sleep into a true alpine immersion. A hotel in the heart of the mountains Accessible in winter exclusively via the slopes by gondola or on skis Accessible in summer by gondola, hiking, or mountain bike An intimate hotel with only 20 rooms The luxury of intimacy and authenticity in the mountains With only twenty rooms and suites, the Refuge Chez La Tante - Mont d'Arbois cultivates the art of discretion and personalization. Here, you are never a simple traveller: you are a privileged host, welcomed in a place designed as a contemporary mountain house. ‍ Whether it is a double room with simple and refined charm, an elegant suite with living room or the remarkable Joly Suite, each accommodation embodies a unique atmosphere. However, all share the same promise: that of peaceful nights, surrounded by nature. The privilege of ski-in ski-out Sleep on the slopes and draw the first curves at sunrise In the morning, all you have to do is open your curtains and the mountain is open to you. The Refuge Chez La Tante - Mont d'Arbois is the only ski-in ski-out hotel on the slopes of Saint-Gervais: you put on your skis at the threshold of your room and become the first to tread on the still virgin snow. ‍ This privilege, reserved for the guests of the Refuge, transforms each stay into an unforgettable experience. Because here, the day starts before the others, in total privacy with the mountains. An exceptional accommodation Rooms and suites in the heart of the mountains Classic room King size 24 m² Designed as a cozy haven, the Classic Cabin Room invites you to refocus on what truly matters: comfort and serenity. Without a balcony, it offers views of the surrounding mountains, allowing you to wake up with a view of the peaks. Its clean lines and warm materials make it an ideal room for an intimate getaway for two, right next to the slopes. DISCOVER Superior room Kin"
