    "final": "https://slh.com/hotels/refuge-de-la-traye",
    "title": "Refuge de la Traye, Luxury Hotel in Meribel, Les Allues, France | SLH",
    "description": "Refuge de la Traye is an eco-luxury chalet retreat in the Alps, offering rustic-chic accommodations, a spa, and stunning mountain views. Book your stay.",
    "text": "Refuge de la Traye, Luxury Hotel in Meribel, Les Allues, France | SLH Discover Destinations Contact Us Hotel Membership Hotel Types Considerate Collection Finest Collection Private Collection Wellbeing Collection Exclusive Offers About SLH JOIN OUR CLUB » Are you an Agent? Agent Login Newsletter Sign-up Swoon by SLH France Italy Spain United Kingdom USA 0800-0482-314 Call Logout » 0800-0482-314 Newsletter Sign-up Explore SLH Magazine Agent Login/Registration AUD CAD CHF CNY EUR GBP JPY SGD USD Menu Bookings Login SLH Club login Make a Reservation Book now » Make a Reservation » Refuge de la Traye Meribel - Les Allues, France Overview Images Rooms Reviews Location Refuge de la Traye will be closed for the season from May to June and October to November. Méribel mountain retreat with true Savoyard spirit Hidden away in the Alps, Refuge de la Traye is the stuff of fairy tales. Taking inspiration from classic Savoie design, its eco-luxury chalets are dotted about a miniature hamlet complete with a chapel, shepherd’s hut and spa. And with spectacular views of the mountains and pine forests from every angle – plus enviable proximity to Les 3 Vallées ski region – you’ll be immersed in nature. The chalets’ rustic wooden and stone exteriors make them a seamless part of the landscape. Inside, it’s a fusion of cosy and chic, with exposed beams and soft furnishings. After a day on the slopes, hang up your boots and relax by the fireplace with a glass of fine Savoyard wine or a locally inspired cocktail. Read more [SPLIT] Read less Its location is Refuge de la Traye’s raison d’être. Away from the hustle and bustle of the après-ski, Refuge de la Traye is a haven of relaxation surrounded by nature. But fear not, Refuge has a shuttle service which means you are never too far from the famous slopes of Les 3 Vallées. If snowplough isn’t your thing, you can also get your heart racing with hot air ballooning, snowshoeing or tobogganing. The alpine landscape is transformed into a haven for hikers, mountain-bikers and sports lovers when the snow melts. 6 Rooms | 3 Floors | 1 Restaurant | 4.8 /5 149 reviews Adventure and Activity Family Friendly Wine Cellar Our Hotel Panoramic View Edelweiss Family Room Lounge Edelweiss Family Cottage Edelweiss Family Cottage Deluxe Room Deluxe Room Suite Orchidee - Winter Deluxe Room Deluxe Room Deluxe Room Deluxe Room Restaurant Breakfast Ski Boutique Spa Spa Sauna Outdoor Pool Nordic Pool Summer Exterior View Summer Exterior View Children Activities Exterior View Exterior View Exterior View Panoramic View 1 / 26 Our rooms Deluxe Room Deluxe Room Deluxe Room 1 / 3 Deluxe Room Sleeps 3 King Select Room » --> Please enter dates to check availability Suite Orchidee 1 / 1 Orchidée Junior Suite Sleeps 3 King Select Room » --> Please enter dates to check availability Edelweiss Family Cottage 1 / 1 Edelweiss Prestige Suite Sleeps 4 King Select Room » --> Please enter dates to check availability Deluxe Room Suite Orchidee Deluxe Room Deluxe "
