    "title": "Airelles Le Grand Contrôle | Château de Versailles",
    "description": "Discover Le Grand Contrôle, a hotel in the heart of the Château de Versailles, for a truly unique experience: exclusive visits, Alain Ducasse restaurant, Airelles Spa with LBA.",
    "text": "Airelles Le Grand Contrôle | Château de Versailles Contenu principal Pied de page Activer le mode contraste élevé Menu Select an item Réserver Home Le Grand Contrôle, Versailles Le Grand Contrôle at the Château de Versailles Immerse yourself in the heart of French history at Le Grand Contrôle. Experience the royal splendor of the 18th century in this exceptional setting within the Château de Versailles. Versailles, Between Two Seasons The nice weather continues at the Château. La Table des Jardiniers keeps its tables set up on the terrace, facing the Orangery, for a peaceful lunch. Picnics are still available so you can enjoy the gardens—basket and tablecloth included. At the end of the day, the Bar de la Chapelle welcomes guests for one last moment before nightfall. At Le Grand Contrôle, the Indian summer lets you extend these moments outdoors a little longer, before the first frosts arrive.Summer is lived outdoors. Previous slide Next slide Previous slide Next slide A Journey Beyond Time During your stay, you will awaken in a majestic room, restored in the style of the era, at the heart of a sumptuous residence offering breathtaking views of the Château de Versailles gardens. From refined fabrics to carefully selected period furniture, every detail creates a luxuriously intimate atmosphere, where chandeliers, gilding, and textiles evoke the authenticity of the place. An exclusive destination for indulging in exceptional moments, following in the footsteps of Marie-Antoinette, the famed Queen of France. For a truly royal experience, enjoy numerous exclusive privileges and personalized attentions, including a personal butler ready to fulfill your every desire. A genuine journey through time, perfect for disconnecting and discovering in all its splendor the Château de Versailles, an iconic symbol of the French monarchy. Lire la suite DISCOVER THE ROOMS AND SUITES The Royal Camp A sailboat to build, a pony in the gardens, a mermaid at the spa: every day, a butler creates a custom program for the children. Extravagant requests granted, seasonal activities, and specialized treatments in collaboration with Minois: the Airelles Royal Camp turns your stay into a fairy tale. DISCOVER Previous slide Next slide Exceptional moment in Versailles Unrivaled Privileges in an Exceptional Surrounding History Room & Suites Restaurants & Bars Spa Experiences Kids Club Moments Private Events Offers Practical Information Previous slide Next slide Legal Notice Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Cookies Management Airelles Our Commitments Jobs Newsletter Send By checking this box, you agree to receive our newsletter by email, including personalized commercial communications about offers, services, products, or events from Les Airelles. You can unsubscribe at any time. For more information, please refer to our Privacy Policy Select an item Event Thanksgiving in Versailles On November 26th, experience Thanksgiving through an exceptional gastronomic journey inspired by the"
