    "description": "Live a unique experience by staying in the very heart of the Château de Versailles in the Grand Contrôle, exceptional flats and suites and exclusive benefits",
    "text": "Palace of Versailles Room | Airelles Château de Versailles Contenu principal Pied de page Activer le mode contraste élevé Menu Select an item Réserver Home Le Grand Contrôle, Versailles Room & Suites Rooms & Suites At Le Grand Contrôle, modern comfort blends seamlessly with imperial splendour. Our 15 rooms and suites are adorned with sumptuous fabrics by Maison Pierre Frey and carefully selected antiques, offering breathtaking views of the Château de Versailles. Deluxe Rooms 2 Adults Baron de Staël-Holstein 2 Adults Turgot 2 Adults L'Orangerie 2 Adults Madame de Fouquet 2 Adults Premier Suites 3 Adults Rose Bertin Suite 4 Adults Marquis de Fouquet Suite 3 Adults Madame de Staël Suite 5 Adults Necker Suite 2 Adults Le Grand Appartement 6 Adults Pavillon des Jardiniers Suite 6/8 Adults Quintinie Suite 2/4 adults Le Nôtre Suite 2/4 Adults A day in your life at Le Grand Contrôle Experience Versailles like never before. Begin with the King's Awakening, featuring butler service, 18th-century music and a candlelit bath, before a refined breakfast and a visit to the Trianon Estate. Unwind at the Airelles Spa or enjoy exclusive experiences, from the Royal Library to a vintage car or light aircraft. In the evening, savour Alain Ducasse's Royal Feast or Grand Banquets before a peaceful night's sleep in a king-size bed. Photos are non-contractual Legal Notice Terms & Conditions Privacy Policy Cookies Management Airelles Our Commitments Jobs Newsletter Send By checking this box, you agree to receive our newsletter by email, including personalized commercial communications about offers, services, products, or events from Les Airelles. You can unsubscribe at any time. For more information, please refer to our Privacy Policy Select an item"
