   {
    "url": "https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/where-to-eat-in-paris/hotel/articles/182847-le-grand-controle-the-magic-hotel-at-the-chateau-de-versailles-that-goes-back-in-time",
    "final": "https://www.sortiraparis.com/en/where-to-eat-in-paris/hotel/articles/182847-le-grand-controle-the-magic-hotel-at-the-chateau-de-versailles-that-goes-back-in-time",
    "title": "Le Grand Contrôle, the magical hotel at the Château de Versailles that goes back in time - Sortiraparis.com",
    "description": "In the heart of the Château de Versailles estate, we discover Le Grand Contrôle, a 5-star hotel offering a unique experience, transporting us back in time. Opening in spring 2020, this unique venue combines history, refinement and authenticity, offering spectacular views over the Orangerie parterre and privileged access to the Château.",
    "text": "Le Grand Contrôle, the magical hotel at the Château de Versailles that goes back in time - Sortiraparis.com Follow us: Professional area Home - Going Out in Paris News × News Interviews & Videos Coronavirus Paris 2024 At Home Epiphany Valentine’s Day St. Patrick’s Day Easter Night of Museums Mother’s Day Music Day Bastille Day Summer in Paris Heritage Days Nuit Blanche Halloween Christmas & Holidays Lunar New Year Innovation Where to eat? × Restaurants Hotels Brunch & cafes Gourmet outings Culture × Shows Museums and Exhibits Theater Shows and Comedy Concert and Music Movies & series History and Heritage Fun × Fairs and exhibitions Sport and Wellness Shopping and Fashion Walks & Nature Gaming Unusual Night × Parisian Nightlife Bars Family Luxury Deals × Free activities Free Invitations Out of Paris × South-West South-East North-West North-East Abroad Agenda My account FAQ / Contact Advertising Professional area Home Where to eat? Hotels Le Grand Contrôle, the magical hotel at the Château de Versailles that goes back in time Le Grand Contrôle, the magical hotel at the Château de Versailles that goes back in time < > Airelles Château de Versailles, Le Grand Contrôle - hotel Published by My de Sortiraparis , Manon de Sortiraparis · Photos by My de Sortiraparis · Updated on February 24, 2025 at 11:14 a.m. In the heart of the Château de Versailles estate, we discover Le Grand Contrôle, a 5-star hotel offering a unique experience, transporting us back in time. Opening in spring 2020, this unique venue combines history, refinement and authenticity, offering spectacular views over the Orangerie parterre and privileged access to the Château. Would you like to visit the Château de Versailles , stay there and live the life of a monarch? The Hotel Le Grand Contrôle Château de Versailles , the historic pearl of Les Airelles , is well worth a visit (or rather, a stay). This 5-star hotel, a veritable historic relic designed by Jules Hardouin-Mansart , Louis XIV's favorite architect, offers an unprecedented experience, blending majesty, history and refinement. It invites us to travel back in time, to an era when the kings and queens of France walked these very corridors. The French Ministry of Culture, in its vision of enhancing the value of historic monuments , has allowed this once derelict building to rise from the ashes. Le Grand Contrôle is not just a hotel. It's a journey back in time, an immersion in the 18th century, a living testimony to the past grandeur of the Château de Versailles. Adjacent to the Château and overlooking the Orangerie, this luxury establishment comprises three historic buildings from the 17th and 18th centuries: the Pavillon des premières cents marches, the Petit Contrôle and the Hôtel du Grand Contrôle. These buildings, which have seen many historical figures pass through their doors, were once home to the Versailles Officers' Mess. Today, under the aegis of Airelles , part of the LOV Hotel Collection group, and in collaboration wit"
