    "title": "Deluxe Room | Airelles Château de Versailles",
    "description": "Book a Deluxe Room at the 5-star Hotel Airelles Le Grand Contrôle overlooking the Pièce d'Eau des Suisses, in the grounds of the Château de Versailles",
    "text": "Deluxe Room | Airelles Château de Versailles Contenu principal Pied de page Activer le mode contraste élevé Menu Select an item Réserver Home Le Grand Contrôle, Versailles Rooms & Suites Deluxe Rooms Deluxe Rooms Stay in a Deluxe room with royal, refined decor at the heart of the Château de Versailles, a symbol of excellence throughout the entire world. Be enchanted by the elegance and intimacy of the Grand Contrôle, as well as the exceptional know-how of our teams, offering the pure and quintessential art of French living as it was back in the time of the Kings. BOOK THIS ROOM Previous slide Next slide High-end Deluxe Rooms with ultimate comfort Just as it did in the time of the Kings, Airelles Château de Versailles welcomes you to a majestic room, bathed in natural light, for a unique, personalised stay. Designed by architect and designer Christophe Tollemer, these sumptuous rooms with herringbone parquet flooring — some featuring marble fireplaces — faithfully recreate the atmosphere of a bygone era. Adorned with dazzling fabrics, the Deluxe Rooms - Orry, Calonne, and Jules Hardouin-Mansart - offer you a memorable stay where the refinement of materials and 18th-century furniture punctuate the authenticity of the place. Rare pieces, carefully selected, bring a touch of elegance to create a marvelous setting where one can stay and feel at home. A synonym for serenity and tranquility, let yourself be transported by the exclusive universe of these royal chambers with their butler. A sublime haven where no detail is left to chance. Lire la suite Practical Information Capacity Non-contractual photos Surface area: 35sqm Capacity: 2 people Orry & Jules Hardouin-Mansart Rooms Period fireplace, 1 shower room (double sink), separate toilet (no water point), floor: herringbone parquet. Sanitary facilities: handmade terracotta tiles. Some amenities may vary depending on the rooms. Possible view: Courtyard and Pièce d’Eau des Suisses or Pièce d’Eau des Suisses and Orangerie Parterre Calonne room 1 shower room (double washbasin), separate WC (single washbasin), floor: herringbone parquet. Sanitary: stone St Maximin and black marble cabochons. Some amenities may vary depending on the rooms. Castle view Services included Gourmet breakfast by Alain Ducasse, Petit Afternoon tea, minibar, access to the Airelles Spa, personal butler service, laundry service for a selection of items, parking and valet service, hot drinks, packing and unpacking service. Exclusive experience As a guest of Le Grand Contrôle, you will enjoy a range of exclusive experiences, including: an exclusive guided visit to the Château de Versailles, Trianon Estate, unlimited access to the Orangery Gardens, access to the Airelles Spa. Unlimited access to our fleet of golf carts. A special welcome for animals A cosy bed, treats, a bespoke menu, surprise gifts and more are provided with pleasure and at no additional charge. Contact +33(0)1 85 36 05 50 reservation.legrandcontrole@airelles.com Le Nôt"
