    "text": "→ Cap Estel · 5-star Luxury Hotel Côte d'Azur Booking English French Hotel La Table du Cap Estel Le Ficus Spa Nuits Dime On Close Home Cap Estel An intimate establishment Travel notes History Commitments Location & getting here Wellbeing & Activities Spa Swimming pools Gardens & private beach Fitness & Activities Rooms & Suites Le Cap La Mer Les Jardins Le Parc Fine dining La Table du Cap Estel* Le Ficus The Bar Events Private receptions Professional events Photo gallery The Cap Estel film Special offers Les Nuits Dime On English French Book a Stay Arrival date Departure date Number of nights Adult(s) Options Book Book a Table Book at La Table du Cap Estel* Book at Le Ficus Book for Dime On Nights Organise a Reception Give a Gift voucher Close Watch the rest of the video Welcome 5-star luxury hotel on the Côte d’Azur Cap Estel Hotel, a haven of beauty, elegance and discretion Set on a two-hectare private peninsula in Eze-Bord-de-Mer, the 5-star Cap Estel Hotel is a unique address with breathtaking panoramas. Endless sea, luxuriant gardens, fountains and water bubbling up from every nook and cranny. Suspended above the waves, boasting Babylon-style Hanging Gardens, the Cap Estel Hotel exudes a feel of Eden and cultivates a certain idea of paradise. Close to Monaco, the major cities of the Côte d'Azur and Italy, and hilltop towns and artists' villages, the luxury Cap Estel Hotel reaches out into the Mediterranean with grace, dignity and reverence. Intensity. Read more Minimize Discover the hotel Discover our experiences Live the Cap Estel experience Watch the rest of the video Discover our intimate establishment Watch the rest of the video The rooms La Table du Cap Estel Watch the rest of the video The spa The best-kept secret of the Côte d'Azur An intimate address set on a private peninsula far from prying eyes, Cap Estel is said to be a confidence, a secret whispered without being disclosed. In reality, Cap Estel is one of those tucked away havens of peace and tranquillity where calm and serenity are the guardians of a blissful sense of freedom. Like a holiday home where you go to recharge your batteries, Cap Estel moves to the rhythm of the friends who moor up on its rocky shores. Here, nature captivates, inspires and invites you to slow down and enjoy a gentler pace of life that will speak to your heart. Step into the secret. Book a stay La Table du Cap Estel* Set within the majestic Manor House of Cap Estel, La Table du Cap Estel offers a truly exceptional 1 Michelin-star fine dining experience led by Chef Kévin Garcia. Inspired by the sea and the estate’s aromatic garden, his precise yet instinctive cuisine delivers creations where technique meets emotion. Each dish celebrates Mediterranean flavours in an elegant setting of marble, light, and sweeping sea views. Discover the gourmet restaurant Book a table Le Ficus Tucked away in the lush gardens between sky and sea, Le Ficus is an invitation to relax and share. Here, Kévin Garcia showcases a"
