   {
    "url": "https://picdumidi.com/en/night-at-the-top",
    "final": "https://picdumidi.com/en/night-at-the-top",
    "title": "Discover the Pic du Midi by night. | Pic du midi",
    "description": "Book a night at the Pic du Midi and experience an unforgettable moment under the stars.",
    "text": "Discover the Pic du Midi by night. | Pic du midi New for 2026: the Hôtellerie des Laquets! At an elevation of 2,620 meters, discover the Hôtellerie des Laquets, overlooking the Pyrenees mountain range. Learn More Night at the top An exceptional night Immersion at the top of the Pyrenees At the summit of the Pic du Midi The Pic du Midi invites you to enjoy a programme full of emotions and discoveries with its exceptional nights. Sunset and sunrise, a night under the stars, access to the observation domes... all this and more for VIP guests. Why not join us ? Check our availability below: To make a booking, please select your arrival date and then your departure date. Would you like to arrive earlier? By choosing one or two single rooms, you’ll be able to secure a booking for a date closer to your preferred date! Our bookings team is on hand to provide further information – reservation@picdumidi.com Would you like to treat someone to a night at the summit? Gift vouchers are not yet available. In the meantime, our booking team is on hand to assist you and suggest the best solution for giving your loved ones this unique experience – reservation@picdumidi.com Bookings for a night at The Laquets hotel are now open! Find out more about The Laquets hotel To display this type of content provided by a third party, you must authorise the following cookies: Marketing Open cookie settings Climbing and visiting the Pic At the end of the day, as all the visitors descend, you have the privilege to spend the night on the Peak! On arrival at the summit, you will be escorted to your room. You'll still have time to wander the terraces and admire the Pyrenees, before enjoying a special welcome cocktail. Sunset and gourmet dinner Then comes one of the first highlights of your evening: From the terrace you can watch the sun slowly descend towards the Pyrenean mountains, playing hide-and-seek with them, setting them ablaze and then suddenly disappearing to make way for night. While the stars settle above you in the Pic du Midi International Starry Sky Reserve, you make your way to the restaurant where a traditional dinner specially concocted by the chef awaits you. Observing the stars Eat well and keep warm, because it's going to be a long and beautiful night. After lunch, your host will guide you in stargazing. If you're an astronomy enthusiast, you're in for a treat! You'll have special access to the Charvin dome, equipped with a 400 mm Schmidt-Cassegrain telescope. This, and the programme of activities and discoveries, thanks to our Instant Science partners. (Only in french ) A short night for a great experience Then it's time to go to your room. The same one used until recently by the scientists, astronomers and technicians for whom the Pic is famous. A sober but comfortable room with a breathtaking view of the mountain and the stars! Sunrise & Scientific quarters To witness the majestic sunrise over the Pyrenees, you need to get out of bed early! After this magical"
