w this room AN EXCEPTIONAL DINNER Le Grand Saint-Michel A unique experience, where flavour, creativity, and innovation prevail. Precise cuisine techniques and passion for quality local products. THE RESTAURANT A TEMPLE OF REST SPA du Relais A haven of calm and care, our spa invites you to unwind with treatments by Anne Semonin. With steam room, sauna, and outdoor jacuzzi overlooking the château, every detail is designed for pure relaxation. Discover more ACTIVITIES Wildlife in the largest enclosed nature reserve in Europe From private safaris to balloon rides or visits to centennial wineries, guests staying at Relais de Chambord have the privilege of enjoying the many experiences offered in the Loire Valley all year round. OUR AGENDA BIKE RIDES BALLOON RIDES ALL THE ACTIVITIES RELAIS DE CHAMBORD, A NATURAL SOURCE OF INSPIRATION Subscribe to our newsletter Subscribe An unforgettable experience EMBARK ON A JOURNEY OF UNIQUE CHARM Contact Press Careers Clef Verte Legal Notice Privacy policy Cookies po"
