    "text": "Suite-Boat La Toue du Relais | Relais Chambord Boutique Hotel | France You are using an outdated browser. Please upgrade your browser to improve your experience. English Français Book Book now Hotel Restaurant Spa BOOK YOUR STAY The Hotel Relais de Chambord Our Surroundings Rooms Dining SPA du Relais Experiences & Offers Les Festins de Chambord Events Gift Vouchers Contact Gallery Newsletter subscription Basic privacy information: The data controller is RELAIS DE CHAMBORD. The purpose is to manage our distribution list and send commercial communications. You have the right to request access, rectification, or deletion, restriction of processing, and data portability, as well as to object to the processing and to file a complaint with a supervisory authority. More information can be found in our privacy policy . Subscribe Floating suite Suite-Boat La Toue du Relais La Toue du Relais A luxurious suite transformed from a traditional Loire riverboat La Toue du Relais, a floating oasis of indulgence on the tranquil Cosson River in the Loire Valley. Our unique and enchanting suite, La Toue du Relais, once a traditional flat-bottomed riverboat, has been exquisitely transformed into a luxurious haven for two. With the iconic Château de Chambord as the stunning backdrop, guests can embark on a truly magical experience by reserving a night aboard our abode. Book now Room Details: Room Surface Area: 30 sqm Terrace Surface Area: 20 sqm Length: 14 m / Width: 4,50 m Bed: 160 Cm Capacity: 2 guests Reversible Heating/Air Conditioning Kitchenette equipped with a fridge, a courtesy tray with a kettle and a Nespresso coffee machine Bathroom with shower Hairdryer Bathrobe and slippers This suite is not pet friendly Accommodation not included in the tourist hotel classification Book now The Toue Cabanée Moored on the Cosson Canal, right next to the castle Step into a world of modern elegance within the private confines of our abode. With an interior design by the esteemed Stefania di Petrillo, the space exudes a seamless blend of sleek, contemporary style and rustic charm with warm wood and supple leather accents throughout. The tranquil ambience is perfect for unwinding and finding respite. Greet the morning with a breathtaking sunrise over the majestic Renaissance turrets and chimneys. Our bespoke breakfast, expertly crafted and served on the deck, offers guests the chance to relish in the peaceful surroundings and admire the stunning view of France’s most picturesque castle. © Philipe Nannetti EXCLUSIVE DINNER ON BOARD Enhance your stay on La Toue du Relais by indulging in an exclusive dining experience on board, boasting breathtaking views of the majestic Château de Chambord and its French gardens. Our delectable menu features a selection of locally sourced, seasonal ingredients crafted into savoury and sweet gourmet tapas. Savour the delectable flavors in the comfort and privacy of our floating suite. Our reservation team is at your disposal for the organisation"
