    "final": "https://www.cabanesnidsdesvosges.com/en",
    "title": "Cabanes Nids des Vosges | Coucoo Cabanes | Grand Est",
    "description": "Treehouses in the Vosges forest, 30 minutes from Épinal and 1 hour 20 minutes from Colmar. Comfortable, unplugged stays for couples or families. Book now.",
    "text": "Cabanes Nids des Vosges | Coucoo Cabanes | Grand Est By using this website, you agree to the storage of cookies on your device to improve site navigation, analyze site usage, and contribute to our marketing efforts. Check out our Privacy Policy for more information. I understand Decline Coucoo Cabins Activities Contact & Access +33 (0)6 32 93 65 74 Language Français English Deutsch Cabins Experiences Wellness Seminars Gift vouchers Book Cabins Discover our huts Tree houses Stilt cabins Hanging huts Experiences Wellness Activities Gift vouchers FAQs Terms and Conditions BLOG Photo gallery Partners Join us Seminars Contact +33 (0) 3 44 58 39 08 Discover our huts Cosy huts Deluxe huts Forêt et spa Huts Oise department Coucoo Cabanes welcome TO c a banes NIDS DES VOSGES Perched in the Vosges forest in Champdray, in the heart of the Vosges mountains between Alsace and Lorraine... Just 30 minutes from Épinal and 1 hour 20 minutes from Colmar, our 14 treehouses (Cosy or Deluxe, featuring a private sauna or Nordic bath) are discreetly nestled among century-old ash trees, giant firs, and majestic beeches on an exceptional natural plateau at an altitude of 700 meters. The Coucoo Cabanes experience means: enjoying breakfast delivered right to your cabin door, setting off to explore the Vosges ridges and Lake Gérardmer, lounging in your Nordic bath beneath the fir trees, experiencing a forest therapy session, and savoring local Vosges dishes hoisted up on a rope when evening falls… 1 rue Jean Cocteau, Chateau de Raray, 60810 Raray OUR cabinS 14 exceptional cabins, each unique and meticulously integrated into its natural surroundings. All of our cabins are equipped with water, electricity, a bathroom (with the exception of the Observatory, which features a water reserve and access to a shower at the reception), heating, indoor and outdoor furniture, full bedding, and a continental breakfast included. Our Deluxe cabins feature a private sauna or a heated Nordic bath on the terrace. Some are accessible to guests with reduced mobility. Our cabins can accommodate 1 to 7 guests, and up to 15 in the Villa Forêt & Spa. Discover all our cabins Domain map cabins PERCHED IN THE TREES Perched 13 to 33 feet up in the branches, these fully equipped cabins offer a true nature getaway above the Vosges forest. Heated and featuring a functional kitchen and a panoramic terrace, they can accommodate 1 to 5 guests. Some feature a living tree inside, while others offer a tower bedroom for children or a massive south-facing picture window. Adventure, without sacrificing an ounce of comfort. Our cabins perched in the trees cabins ON STILTS IN THE FOREST For those looking to combine a reconnection with nature and refined luxury . With a panoramic treehouse sauna (Bien-Hêtre), a heated Nordic bath on the terrace, a transparent dome for stargazing, and a vast two-level forest space… these exceptional cabins, accommodating 1 to 7 guests, are nests you’ll never want to leave. Our cabins"
   },
