 Mobile hotel Solidarity hotel Unusual cottage Unusual guest room Unusual hotel Unusual hotel project Youth hostel Hotels-insolites.com > France > Unusual hotel Rhône-Alpes > Les Folies de la Serve Les Folies de la Serve Photos : Source Booking.com Unusual night between Burgundy and Beaujolais Arrival Departure In partnership with Presentation Practical information Once upon a time... a princess room from the 1001 nights. Would you imagine staying in the dreamlike world of an Indian princess's room during a getaway in the mountains of Haut Beaujolais? Yet in this beautiful Beaujolais Vert countryside, 1 hour from Lyon and 2 hours from Geneva, Les Folies de la Serve take their guests on a journey in a surprising setting with shimmering colors. A bed and breakfast worthy of a tale from the Arabian Nights and the attentive and discreet hospitality of Pascaline and Pascal make this address a charming destination shared like a sweet secret. Two authentic gypsy caravans carefully restored also invite you"
