    "title": "~ Accommodations | Lodge Auvergne Spa | Écrin d'Auvergne Lodges & Spa",
    "description": "Official Website ✅ Best Rates in Direct: Stay in an exceptional lodge with private spa on the terrace, in Auvergne. Book on our website.",
    "text": "~ Accommodations | Lodge Auvergne Spa | Écrin d'Auvergne Lodges & Spa Menu Book Menu Book Close Book Home Lodges Eating Experiences Wellness Discover Gallery Gift The blog Contact & Access FAQ FR Lodges Lodge in Auvergne with spa Ecrin d’Auvergne, high quality Lodges with private Jacuzzi Between a charming country hôtel and ‘chambres d’hôtes’, we offer a completely new and intimate concept. The property is dotted with 6 Lodges all facing due south . Each Lodge, with its emphasis on nature welcomes 2 adults (Adults only) and benefits from a unique intimacy, as thanks to the vegetation which surrounds it, there is NO open view to the other Lodges. Learn more Discover our Lodges Discover our Lodges Private Lodge with Jacuzzi & bioclimatic Pergola 2 pers. | 31m² | Terr. 24m² from 260 € Private Lodge with Jacuzzi & Summer-house 2 pers. | 31m2 | Terr. 24m2 | Summerhouse 12m2 from 290 € Each Lodge is equipped with A suite with a high-quality Queen-sized bed Shower room with large walk-in shower All bed linen and shower products, bath robe and welcome package. Kitchenette to reheat meals (microwave and mini-bar) Coffee maker with ground coffee. Courtesy tray with coffee, tea, infusion tea. Music streaming through Bluetooth speaker Breakfast Breakfast is called the most important meal of the day, so if we want to fully appreciate our day, it has to be tasty and generous. Most of our food is organic (fruit juice, coffee, tea, jam) whenever we can locally sourced, (home-made yoghurt) and “Fair Trade”. Your breakfast is delivered to your Lodge; in your basket you will find fruit juice, coffee, tea, chocolate, bread and pastries (either from the village baker or baked on site), butter, jam and honey, fruit in season, and also home-made yoghurt and in option eggs, local cheeses, charcuterie from the Cantal. . Breakfast is included for all Lodges : YES Holiday suggestions Nuit Romantique One night in a Lodge with breakfast and dinner for 2 Make it a surprise: with a “Nuit Romantique” everything is included, dinner for 2, ½ bottle of champagne as an aperitif, rose petals, candles and breakfast for 2 the next morning. Private Lodge with Jacuzzi & bioclimatic Pergola 2 pers. | 31m² | Terr. 24m² book from 260 € Wonderfully light thanks to the large bay windows, you can feel as if you are part of the large meadow in front of your Lodge whilst still feeling cosy inside. Breakfast included Yes Each Lodge is equipped with A suite with a high-quality Queen-sized bed Shower room with large walk-in shower All bed linen and shower products, bath robe and welcome package. Kitchenette to reheat meals (microwave and mini-bar) Coffee maker with ground coffee. Courtesy tray with coffee, tea, infusion tea. Music streaming through Bluetooth speaker Private Lodge with Jacuzzi & Summer-house 2 pers. | 31m2 | Terr. 24m2 | Summerhouse 12m2 book from 290 € Immersed in nature, the sound of the stream below soothes you, hence the name of the lodge \"Quiétude\". Breakfast included Yes Each"
