    "description": "Official Website ✅ Best Rates in Direct: High-end ecolodges with private spa in the heart of nature, in Auvergne. Book on our website.",
    "text": "~ Écrin d'Auvergne Lodges & Spa | Ecolodge with Spa in Auvergne Menu Book Menu Book Close Book Home Lodges Eating Experiences Wellness Discover Gallery Gift The blog Contact & Access FAQ FR Le film Le film Ecolodge with private spa in Auvergne Take a break , away from the pressures of life. Ecrin d’Auvergne Lodges and Jacuzzi will give you a break, away from the stresses of life. Our concept of High Quality Lodges is Adults Only (holidays without children). We invite you to experience a total immersion in nature and your Lodge, a veritable haven and sanctuary will guarantee you a gentle and relaxing experience. All our Lodges offer complete privacy with clear views of nature. The natural materials used make for a feeling of peace and well-being. The private Jacuzzi on your terrace is always available. Ecrin d’Auvergne's 12 hectares (29 acres) in The Auvergne Volcanoes National Park offers a unique experience and is the perfect place to recharge your batteries. Book a Lodge Between a charming country hotel and ‘chambres d’hôtes’, we offer a completely new intimate experience . Between a charming country hotel and ‘chambres d’hôtes’, we offer a new and intimate experience. The property consists of 6 Lodges all facing due south. Private Lodges with their own Jacuzzi and a bioclimatic pergola Lodge Private Jacuzzi Sérénité Lodge Private Jacuzzi Parenthèse Lodge Private Jacuzzi Échapée Lodge Private Jacuzzi Songe Lodge Private Jacuzzi Escapade Lodges with a Jacuzzi & summerhouse Lodge Private Jacuzzi Quiétude Book a Lodge You will love Your Lodge in the middle of nature. An open view of the meadow, stream and the lake. Your private terrace with Jacuzzi at a permanent 37° accessible day and night. The peaceful and relaxing atmosphere of your Lodge. The pampering service just for you. Your cosy nest. For your well-being The idea of ‘Adults Only’, holidays without children. An intimate place completely open to nature. Personal welcome, with ideas for visits, trips and good restaurants. Jacuzzi on your terrace accessible 24 hrs a day. Generous and tasty breakfast. Simple but delicious meals. Sorry, your browser doesn't support embedded videos. Jean Louis GACHE 01/06/2026 Trustindex vérifie que la source originale de l'avis est Google. Au coeur de la nature, ce site porte \" très \" bien son nom : Ecrin d'Auvergne insolite ! Dans un confort très soigné, plongé dans une eau bouillonnante, on se laisse bercer le soir par le coassement des grenouilles et attendrir le matin par la démarche nonchalante d'une biche ! L'instant est là, simple, vrai, authentique... N'hésitez pas ! Réponse du propriétaire Immersion totale en pleine nature et cocooning ! c'est exactement l'expérience que nous souhaitons faire vivre à nos hôtes. Merci à vous deux pour votre témoignage ... et votre rencontre. Sandra Costa 01/06/2026 Trustindex vérifie que la source originale de l'avis est Google. Tout a été parfait du début à la fin ! L'accueil a été chaleureux et attentionné. ​Le cadre"
