    "title": "~ Discover | Stay in Auvergne | Écrin d'Auvergne Lodges & Spa",
    "description": "Official Website ✅ Discover the Auvergne region during an unusual stay in a lodge in the heart of the Parc Naturel des Volcans d'Auvergne.",
    "text": "~ Discover | Stay in Auvergne | Écrin d'Auvergne Lodges & Spa Menu Book Menu Book Close Book Home Lodges Eating Experiences Wellness Discover Gallery Gift The blog Contact & Access FAQ FR Discover Your stay in Auvergne On the spot To make your stay even better, we have several ideas for you: A circuit of the nearby countryside on an electric bike 2hrs A walk 3h30 Wildlife watching (deer, birds of prey, frogs, dragon flies) and wild flowers Table tennis Pétanque Baby-foot In the Auvergne Volcanoes National Park Ecrin d’Auvergne offers High Quality Lodges each with their own private Jacuzzi in the heart of the Auvergne Volcanoes National Park. Nature, volcanoes, and wide open countryside is everywhere. As soon as you arrive, you benefit from a personal welcome so that you can plan your stay in the National Park according to your taste. We can help you with various suggestions: The Lakes of la Crégut and Lastioulles (with its classified Pavillon Bleu beach and sailing base - paddle boards, catamarans, pedaloes, wind surfers and canoes for hire) 3kms Beautiful walks,on horseback, or on an electric bicycle, are all around the Lodges (25 different ideas of which 1 by electric bicycle starts at Ecrin d’Auvergne. The Sancy range of mountains with its 2 sides, le Mont Dore and Super Besse and not forgetting the stunning Lac Pavin, and the medieval village of Besse en Chandesse: visit of ½ a day. La chaîne des Puys (UNESCO site) with the Puy de Dôme and its mountain train and 70 volcanoes. Le Puy Mary in the Cantal, the biggest volcano in Europe, and Salers, medieval village. Day trip Apart from various walks on the volcanoes, round the lakes, you can also discover other extraordinary sites: The Château de Val (saved from being flooded when the Dam on the Dordogne was built) The hydro electric dam across the Dordogne, the first dam on the Dordogne Not forgetting the culinary specialities of the region, la Truffade, Aligot, Cantal, St. Nectaire . . . have a look at the page about food. Good restaurants not far In the welcome guide, you will find our suggestions for good restaurants nearby. These range from the most authentic with excellent local specialities (Truffade, Chou Farci, Quailles aux raisins) to the refined that provide fine dining. Jean Louis GACHE 01/06/2026 Trustindex vérifie que la source originale de l'avis est Google. Au coeur de la nature, ce site porte \" très \" bien son nom : Ecrin d'Auvergne insolite ! Dans un confort très soigné, plongé dans une eau bouillonnante, on se laisse bercer le soir par le coassement des grenouilles et attendrir le matin par la démarche nonchalante d'une biche ! L'instant est là, simple, vrai, authentique... N'hésitez pas ! Réponse du propriétaire Immersion totale en pleine nature et cocooning ! c'est exactement l'expérience que nous souhaitons faire vivre à nos hôtes. Merci à vous deux pour votre témoignage ... et votre rencontre. Sandra Costa 01/06/2026 Trustindex vérifie que la source originale de l'avis est "
