ity is limited to our restaurant (terrace and green lounge) due to the configuration of the premises and the constraints linked to the classification as a historical monument. Free WiFi In-room safe Air conditioning Master Suite Between 45 and 60 sq.m River view La Favorite sticky-booking-button Master Suite La Favorite 3 persons | 60 m² | view overlooking the Dordogne River. Located on the first floor with an exceptional view overlooking the Dordogne river, its large room is south-facing surmounted by magnificent Gothic woodwork that adorns all the ceiling. Period furniture Louis XIV and its large white bathroom turn gold every evening from the rays of the setting sun. Its dressing room and ensuite suite has an extra bed for one person. The room is also equipped with the best equipment: electrical shutters to ensure acoustic comfort while preserving the aesthetics of the mullioned windows (classified historical heritage), electrically operated curtains, 3 way air conditioning to ensure the exact d"
