s are available at the hotel reception. It is recommended that reservation be made in advance. Fishing Period Ideal year round For everyone The UNESCO has listed the Dordogne as a World Biosphere Reserve. On site, you can fish in one of the most well stocked rivers in France. The Dordogne has its source in the Massif Central and flows through our region before it ends in the Atlantic Ocean. Many anglers enjoy fishing pike, pike perch, roach, eel and lamprey. We suggest that you go fishing with a real pro who will take you to unusual places on the Dordogne Canoë & Kayak Period Ideal Year round For everyone The Dordogne River is also a paradise for canoeing and kayaking. The COPEYRE Canoe Base is located only a few miles from the Château de la Treyne. A bus picks you up directly at the entrance of the estate. According to your schedule and your level of acquaintance with this sport, you can start your canoe descent from Creysse or from Meyronne. An unforgettable outing with a picnic prepared by our C"
